-- en: "Test opens one condition-level dialog from any callback tab. It renders Fields UI and Help together with detached values. Committing a field value validates and evaluates once. Run test refreshes the current values, while only valid values are evaluated. Opening the dialog does not evaluate defaults. Live is opt-in and stops when the dialog closes. Committed test values are available to the debugger and stay separate from source, exports and rotation edits. Check syntax never runs a callback."
L["Test opens one condition-level dialog from any callback tab. It renders Fields UI and Help together with detached values. Committing a field value validates and evaluates once. Run test refreshes the current values, while only valid values are evaluated. Opening the dialog does not evaluate defaults. Live is opt-in and stops when the dialog closes. Committed test values are available to the debugger and stay separate from source, exports and rotation edits. Check syntax never runs a callback."] = "「測試」會從任一回呼分頁開啟一個條件層級的對話框。它會搭配獨立的測試值同時繪製欄位介面與說明。提交一個欄位值會驗證並評估一次。「執行測試」會重新整理目前的值，但只評估有效的值。開啟對話框不會評估預設值。「即時」需手動開啟，並在對話框關閉時停止。已提交的測試值可供偵錯器使用，並與原始碼、匯出內容及循環編輯互相獨立。「檢查語法」從不執行回呼。"
