L["This name is already in use."] = "此名稱已被使用。"
-- en: "Branch"
L["Branch"] = "分支"
-- en: "Choose a category and search for a condition. Hidden removes it from pickers without deleting its definition. Switch Condition controls its availability for automatic rotation switching. Move To changes its category; order arrows arrange category entries. Custom conditions can be edited, duplicated or deleted."
L["Choose a category and search for a condition. Hidden removes it from pickers without deleting its definition. Switch Condition controls its availability for automatic rotation switching. Move To changes its category; order arrows arrange category entries. Custom conditions can be edited, duplicated or deleted."] = "選擇一個分類並搜尋條件。「隱藏」會將其從選擇器中移除，但不刪除其定義。「切換條件」控制它能否用於自動切換循環。「移動到」會變更其分類；排序箭頭可調整分類中各項目的順序。自訂條件可以編輯、複製或刪除。"
-- en: "Choose a current profile or enter a new profile name and create it. Copy replaces the current profile’s settings; Reset restores defaults. Delete removes another saved profile. Copy, Reset and Delete ask for confirmation."
L["Choose a current profile or enter a new profile name and create it. Copy replaces the current profile’s settings; Reset restores defaults. Delete removes another saved profile. Copy, Reset and Delete ask for confirmation."] = "選擇一個目前設定檔，或輸入新的設定檔名稱並建立。「從設定檔複製」會取代目前設定檔的設定；「重設」會還原預設值。「刪除」會移除另一個已儲存的設定檔。「從設定檔複製」「重設」與「刪除」都會要求確認。"
-- en: "Choose an item set and edit its priority list. Global shares the set across profiles. Move arrows change item priority. Bind item set picks up an available item for placement on an action bar; Remove binding unlinks it. Reset restores a packaged set. Import replaces its item list."
L["Choose an item set and edit its priority list. Global shares the set across profiles. Move arrows change item priority. Bind item set picks up an available item for placement on an action bar; Remove binding unlinks it. Reset restores a packaged set. Import replaces its item list."] = "選擇一個物品組並編輯其優先順序清單。「全域」會在所有設定檔間共用該物品組。移動箭頭可變更物品優先順序。「綁定物品組」會拿起一件可用物品以放置到快捷列上；「移除綁定」會解除其連結。「重設」會還原內建的物品組。「匯入」會取代其物品清單。"
-- en: "Choose and edit"
L["Choose and edit"] = "選擇與編輯"
-- en: "Click a condition type to search or browse categories. Dismissing the picker or choosing the same type keeps its fields. Click the condition summary to edit its fields. The chevron switches between name only and summary; the double chevron closes the fields."
L["Click a condition type to search or browse categories. Dismissing the picker or choosing the same type keeps its fields. Click the condition summary to edit its fields. The chevron switches between name only and summary; the double chevron closes the fields."] = "點擊條件類型以搜尋或瀏覽分類。關閉選擇器或選擇相同類型會保留其欄位。點擊條件摘要可編輯其欄位。單箭頭在僅名稱與摘要之間切換；雙箭頭會關閉欄位。"
-- en: "Click a name to rename it. Clear a custom step name to restore its action name. Click a collapsed title to show its summary. Click action or condition text to open its details; the double chevron returns from fields to the summary."
L["Click a name to rename it. Clear a custom step name to restore its action name. Click a collapsed title to show its summary. Click action or condition text to open its details; the double chevron returns from fields to the summary."] = "點擊名稱可重新命名。清除自訂步驟名稱會還原其動作名稱。點擊已摺疊的標題可顯示其摘要。點擊動作或條件文字可開啟詳情；雙箭頭會從欄位返回摘要。"
-- en: "Click condition text to edit when this card can run. Enabled / Disabled preserves the card while switching its participation. Actions also require known or carried actions, usable resources, cooldown readiness and valid range."
L["Click condition text to edit when this card can run. Enabled / Disabled preserves the card while switching its participation. Actions also require known or carried actions, usable resources, cooldown readiness and valid range."] = "當此卡片可以執行時，點擊條件文字可進行編輯。「啟用 / 停用」會保留卡片，僅切換其是否參與。動作還要求已知或攜帶的動作、足夠的資源、冷卻就緒以及有效距離。"
-- en: "Click the action to edit its type, spell or item. The leading icon previews the effect. Effect selects a style; Magnification changes its size. Click the swatch or edit RGBA on the 0–1 scale. Arrows adjust position; V / H show offsets. Default restores profile values. Sound selection and Play preview an audible reminder."
L["Click the action to edit its type, spell or item. The leading icon previews the effect. Effect selects a style; Magnification changes its size. Click the swatch or edit RGBA on the 0–1 scale. Arrows adjust position; V / H show offsets. Default restores profile values. Sound selection and Play preview an audible reminder."] = "點擊動作可編輯其類型、法術或物品。前面的圖示會預覽效果。「效果」選擇樣式；「放大倍率」改變其大小。點擊色塊或按 0–1 範圍編輯 RGBA。箭頭調整位置；縱 / 橫 顯示偏移量。「預設」還原設定檔中的值。選擇音效並點擊「播放」可預覽音效提醒。"
-- en: "Click the guard text to edit the branch condition. Evaluate uses that condition; Always true / Always false skips it. False is left and red; True is right and green. The branch icon hides both arms without changing them. Click True or False to fold only that arm; its hidden count remains visible. Gray cards in a forced arm are unreachable."
L["Click the guard text to edit the branch condition. Evaluate uses that condition; Always true / Always false skips it. False is left and red; True is right and green. The branch icon hides both arms without changing them. Click True or False to fold only that arm; its hidden count remains visible. Gray cards in a forced arm are unreachable."] = "點擊防護文字可編輯分支條件。「評估條件」使用該條件；「總是為真 / 總是為假」會略過它。「假」在左側，顯示為紅色；「真」在右側，顯示為綠色。分支圖示會隱藏兩個分支但不變更它們。點擊「真」或「假」只摺疊該分支；其隱藏數量仍然可見。強制分支中的灰色卡片無法到達。"
-- en: "Condition editor"
L["Condition editor"] = "條件編輯器"
-- en: "Conditions and state"
L["Conditions and state"] = "條件與狀態"
-- en: "Configure recommendation timing, automatic switching, history, preview and profile highlight defaults. Labels are on the left. Checkboxes toggle options, sliders show numeric values, and fields validate before saving."
L["Configure recommendation timing, automatic switching, history, preview and profile highlight defaults. Labels are on the left. Checkboxes toggle options, sliders show numeric values, and fields validate before saving."] = "設定建議的時機、自動切換、歷史、預覽以及設定檔的預設醒目提示。標籤位於左側。核取方塊用於開關選項，滑桿顯示數值，欄位會在儲存前進行驗證。"
-- en: "Description and attribution"
L["Description and attribution"] = "說明與署名"
-- en: "Drag one card into a highlighted gap; hold Ctrl when starting the drag to carry that card and all following siblings. A branch always carries its children. Use Up / Down on the left to move one card. Duplicate copies the card and the red trash can deletes it. Cooldowns are independent, so they have no move arrows."
L["Drag one card into a highlighted gap; hold Ctrl when starting the drag to carry that card and all following siblings. A branch always carries its children. Use Up / Down on the left to move one card. Duplicate copies the card and the red trash can deletes it. Cooldowns are independent, so they have no move arrows."] = "將一張卡片拖入醒目標示的空隙；開始拖曳時按住 Ctrl，可帶上該卡片及其後所有同層卡片。分支總是會帶上其子項目。使用左側的「上移 / 下移」移動單張卡片。「複製」會複製卡片，紅色垃圾桶會刪除它。冷卻是獨立的，因此沒有移動箭頭。"
-- en: "Drag a card into one highlighted gap, or use the left-side Up / Down arrows. Hold Ctrl when starting a drag to carry the card and all following siblings. Groups always carry their children. Unavailable moves are gray. Ctrl-click or Shift-click selects several cards for grouping; dragging an existing selection moves that selection. Duplicate copies a card; Split group removes its wrapper; the red trash can deletes it. Add condition and Add group append when clicked or insert where dropped."
L["Drag a card into one highlighted gap, or use the left-side Up / Down arrows. Hold Ctrl when starting a drag to carry the card and all following siblings. Groups always carry their children. Unavailable moves are gray. Ctrl-click or Shift-click selects several cards for grouping; dragging an existing selection moves that selection. Duplicate copies a card; Split group removes its wrapper; the red trash can deletes it. Add condition and Add group append when clicked or insert where dropped."] = "將卡片拖入一個醒目標示的空隙，或使用左側的「上移 / 下移」箭頭。開始拖曳時按住 Ctrl，可帶上該卡片及其後所有同層卡片。群組總是會帶上其子項目。無法執行的移動顯示為灰色。Ctrl+點擊或 Shift+點擊可選取多張卡片進行組合；拖曳已有的選取範圍會移動整個選取範圍。「複製」會複製卡片；「拆分群組」會移除其外層包裝；紅色垃圾桶會刪除它。「新增條件」與「新增群組」在點擊時附加到結尾，或在拖放處插入。"
-- en: "Drag the title bar to move. Set Scale with the top-left slider; child windows follow it. The question mark toggles Help. Close with X, Escape, or right-click in the content area."
L["Drag the title bar to move. Set Scale with the top-left slider; child windows follow it. The question mark toggles Help. Close with X, Escape, or right-click in the content area."] = "拖曳標題列可移動視窗。使用左上角的滑桿設定縮放；子視窗會隨之縮放。問號按鈕可開關說明。可透過 X、Esc 鍵或在內容區域右鍵點擊來關閉。"
-- en: "Edit the description, author, realm, email, website and version. Source citations remain separate from your attribution. Use changes updates the rotation draft; Apply the rotation to save it. Cancel or Escape restores this dialog’s opening values."
L["Edit the description, author, realm, email, website and version. Source citations remain separate from your attribution. Use changes updates the rotation draft; Apply the rotation to save it. Cancel or Escape restores this dialog’s opening values."] = "編輯說明、作者、伺服器、電子郵件、網站與版本。來源引用與你的署名分開保存。「使用變更」會更新循環草稿；套用循環以儲存。「取消」或 Esc 鍵會還原此對話框開啟時的值。"
-- en: "Editing settings"
L["Editing settings"] = "編輯設定"
-- en: "Expand an announcement to choose its action, event, channel and text. Spell fields search the catalog; exact rank limits matching to that rank. Enabled toggles the announcement. Add announcement creates a new entry after an action is selected."
L["Expand an announcement to choose its action, event, channel and text. Spell fields search the catalog; exact rank limits matching to that rank. Enabled toggles the announcement. Add announcement creates a new entry after an action is selected."] = "展開一則通報以選擇其動作、事件、頻道與文字。法術欄位會搜尋法術目錄；精確等級會將比對限制為該等級。「已啟用」用於開關該通報。選擇動作後，「新增通報」會建立一個新項目。"
-- en: "Groups and toggles"
L["Groups and toggles"] = "群組與開關"
-- en: "Help and saving"
L["Help and saving"] = "說明與儲存"
-- en: "Highlight effects"
L["Highlight effects"] = "醒目提示效果"
-- en: "If / Unless toggles negation. Enabled / Disabled keeps the saved fields while skipping evaluation. All / Any changes AND / OR. Click a group name to rename it; the branch icon hides or shows its children. Gray descendants cannot be reached."
L["If / Unless toggles negation. Enabled / Disabled keeps the saved fields while skipping evaluation. All / Any changes AND / OR. Click a group name to rename it; the branch icon hides or shows its children. Gray descendants cannot be reached."] = "「如果 / 除非」用於切換反轉。「啟用 / 停用」會保留已儲存的欄位，但略過評估。「全部 / 任一」在 AND / OR 之間切換。點擊群組名稱可重新命名；分支圖示可隱藏或顯示其子項目。灰色的子項目無法到達。"
-- en: "Move, copy and remove"
L["Move, copy and remove"] = "移動、複製與移除"
-- en: "Names and details"
L["Names and details"] = "名稱與詳情"
-- en: "Search or filter the rotation roster, then select a rotation. Blue Built In rotations use the same editor but remain read-only; Duplicate makes an editable copy. The name and Metadata describe the rotation. Switch condition selects when it applies. Use the Rotation and Cooldowns tabs to select the content below the switch condition. Cooldowns highlight independently of the ordered rotation."
L["Search or filter the rotation roster, then select a rotation. Blue Built In rotations use the same editor but remain read-only; Duplicate makes an editable copy. The name and Metadata describe the rotation. Switch condition selects when it applies. Use the Rotation and Cooldowns tabs to select the content below the switch condition. Cooldowns highlight independently of the ordered rotation."] = "搜尋或篩選循環清單，然後選擇一個循環。藍色的內建循環使用相同的編輯器，但維持唯讀；「複製」會建立一個可編輯的複本。名稱與中繼資料用於描述循環。切換條件決定它何時適用。使用「循環」與「冷卻」分頁選擇切換條件下方顯示的內容。冷卻獨立於有序循環進行醒目提示。"
-- en: "Select an effect to edit its name, type and type-specific settings. The icon previews it live. Sequence sections edit animation, color, pulse or custom frames in order. Duplicate creates an independent effect. Import replaces the selected effect after validation."
L["Select an effect to edit its name, type and type-specific settings. The icon previews it live. Sequence sections edit animation, color, pulse or custom frames in order. Duplicate creates an independent effect. Import replaces the selected effect after validation."] = "選擇一個效果以編輯其名稱、類型及該類型特有的設定。圖示會即時預覽效果。序列部分依序編輯動畫、顏色、脈衝或自訂影格。「複製」會建立一個獨立的效果。「匯入」會在驗證後取代所選效果。"
-- en: "The question mark opens full Help for its subject. Hover controls for brief tips. Undo / Redo affect the draft. Apply saves; Discard or Cancel abandons draft changes. Red borders mark invalid or incomplete data."
L["The question mark explains the visible controls. With condition fields open, it adds that condition’s help below the fields. Undo / Redo affect the draft. Apply saves; Discard or Cancel abandons draft changes. Red borders mark invalid or incomplete data."] = "問號按鈕會開啟該主題的完整說明。將滑鼠停留在控制項上可檢視簡短提示。復原 / 重做影響草稿。「套用」會儲存；「捨棄」或「取消」會丟棄草稿變更。紅色邊框標示無效或不完整的資料。"
-- en: "These settings apply immediately. Press Enter or leave a text field to commit it. Invalid text stays red and blocks navigation until corrected. Searchable selectors open on click and filter as you type. Section headings collapse or expand their contents."
L["These settings apply immediately. Press Enter or leave a text field to commit it. Invalid text stays red and blocks navigation until corrected. Searchable selectors open on click and filter as you type. Section headings collapse or expand their contents."] = "這些設定會立即生效。按 Enter 或離開文字欄位即可提交。無效文字會維持紅色，並在更正前阻止頁面切換。可搜尋的選擇器在點擊時開啟，並隨輸入進行篩選。分節標題可摺疊或展開其內容。"
-- en: "Using this page"
L["Using this page"] = "使用此頁面"
-- en: "Version, author, credits and project links are shown here. Click a link field to select its text for copying."
L["Version, author, credits and project links are shown here. Click a link field to select its text for copying."] = "此處顯示版本、作者、致謝與專案連結。點擊連結欄位可選取其文字以便複製。"
-- en: "Window controls"
L["Window controls"] = "視窗控制項"
-- en: "Unknown spell"
L["Unknown spell"] = "未知法術"
-- en: "Item data loading"
L["Item data loading"] = "物品資料載入中"
-- en: "Primary"
L["Primary"] = "主要"
-- en: "Secondary"
L["Secondary"] = "次要"
-- en: "No matches."
L["No matches."] = "無相符項目。"
-- en: "New"
L["New"] = "新增"
-- en: "No matching items."
L["No matching items."] = "沒有相符的物品。"
-- en: "Click a result or enter an item name, ID or link."
L["Click a result or enter an item name, ID or link."] = "點擊結果，或輸入物品名稱、ID 或連結。"
-- en: "Anchor"
L["Anchor"] = "錨點"
-- en: "Return the preview window to the center of the screen."
L["Return the preview window to the center of the screen."] = "將預覽視窗移回螢幕中央。"
-- en: "The icon shows your selected profile effect, color, size, anchor and offsets."
L["The icon shows your selected profile effect, color, size, anchor and offsets."] = "圖示顯示你所選設定檔的效果、顏色、大小、錨點與偏移。"
-- en: "Vertical offset in pixels. Up and Down change it; hold Shift for ten pixels. Center resets both offsets."
L["Vertical offset in pixels. Up and Down change it; hold Shift for ten pixels. Center resets both offsets."] = "以像素為單位的垂直偏移。「上」與「下」可變更它；按住 Shift 每次移動十像素。「置中」會重設兩個偏移。"
-- en: "Horizontal offset in pixels. Left and Right change it; hold Shift for ten pixels. Center resets both offsets."
L["Horizontal offset in pixels. Left and Right change it; hold Shift for ten pixels. Center resets both offsets."] = "以像素為單位的水平偏移。「左」與「右」可變更它；按住 Shift 每次移動十像素。「置中」會重設兩個偏移。"
-- en: "Manage categories"
L["Manage categories"] = "管理分類"
-- en: "Back to conditions"
L["Back to conditions"] = "返回條件"
-- en: "Built-in category"
L["Built-in category"] = "內建分類"
-- en: "Delete category"
L["Delete category"] = "刪除分類"
-- en: "Delete this category? Its conditions will remain available under Other."
L["Delete this category? Its conditions will remain available under Other."] = "刪除此分類？其中的條件仍可在「其他」下使用。"
-- en: "Filter the condition list by All, Switch, Custom, Other or a named category. Search narrows the visible conditions without changing their category."
L["Filter the condition list by All, Switch, Custom, Other or a named category. Search narrows the visible conditions without changing their category."] = "依「全部」「切換」「自訂」「其他」或某個命名分類篩選條件清單。搜尋會縮小可見條件的範圍，但不改變其分類。"
-- en: "Open Manage categories below the list for category maintenance. Back to conditions returns to individual condition settings."
L["Open Manage categories below the list for category maintenance. Back to conditions returns to individual condition settings."] = "開啟清單下方的「管理分類」以維護分類。「返回條件」會回到單一條件的設定。"
-- en: "Rename the selected category in Manage categories. Built-in categories cannot be renamed or deleted."
L["Rename the selected category in Manage categories. Built-in categories cannot be renamed or deleted."] = "在「管理分類」中重新命名所選分類。內建分類不能重新命名或刪除。"
-- en: "Add an empty named category from the category-management list. Move To in condition settings assigns a condition to it."
L["Add an empty named category from the category-management list. Move To in condition settings assigns a condition to it."] = "從分類管理清單中新增一個空的命名分類。條件設定中的「移動到」可將條件指派給它。"
-- en: "In Manage categories, move the selected category earlier in the category list."
L["In Manage categories, move the selected category earlier in the category list."] = "在「管理分類」中，將所選分類在分類清單中前移。"
-- en: "In Manage categories, move the selected category later in the category list."
L["In Manage categories, move the selected category later in the category list."] = "在「管理分類」中，將所選分類在分類清單中後移。"
-- en: "Delete a named category after confirmation. Its conditions remain available under Other; their definitions are preserved."
L["Delete a named category after confirmation. Its conditions remain available under Other; their definitions are preserved."] = "確認後刪除一個命名分類。其中的條件仍可在「其他」下使用；其定義會被保留。"
-- en: "In Manage categories, copy or replace a category’s ordered condition identifiers. Named categories and Other are exclusive destinations. Switch membership is independent."
L["In Manage categories, copy or replace a category’s ordered condition identifiers. Named categories and Other are exclusive destinations. Switch membership is independent."] = "在「管理分類」中，複製或取代某個分類中依序排列的條件識別碼。命名分類與「其他」是互斥的目標。「切換」成員資格是獨立的。"
-- en: "Filter the visible condition list by name or identifier. The category filter still applies."
L["Filter the visible condition list by name or identifier. The category filter still applies."] = "依名稱或識別碼篩選可見的條件清單。分類篩選仍然適用。"
-- en: "Allow this condition type to be used when automatically selecting a rotation."
L["Allow this condition type to be used when automatically selecting a rotation."] = "允許在自動選擇循環時使用此條件類型。"
-- en: "Hide this condition from the Other picker category. Explicit named-category and Switch membership remain available."
L["Hide this condition from the Other picker category. Explicit named-category and Switch membership remain available."] = "在選擇器的「其他」分類中隱藏此條件。明確的命名分類與「切換」成員資格仍然可用。"
-- en: "Condition order"
L["Condition order"] = "條件順序"
-- en: "The condition ordering controls in condition settings move the selected condition to the top, up, down or to the bottom within its current category. These are separate from the Up and Down controls for category order."
L["The condition ordering controls in condition settings move the selected condition to the top, up, down or to the bottom within its current category. These are separate from the Up and Down controls for category order."] = "條件設定中的條件排序控制項可將所選條件在其目前分類中移到最上方、上移、下移或移到最下方。它們與分類順序的「上移」與「下移」控制項是分開的。"
-- en: "Move the selected condition to a named category or Other. Use Switch Condition separately for automatic-switch availability."
L["Move the selected condition to a named category or Other. Use Switch Condition separately for automatic-switch availability."] = "將所選條件移動到某個命名分類或「其他」。是否可用於自動切換請另外使用「切換條件」設定。"
-- en: "Yes"
L["Yes"] = "是"
-- en: "No"
L["No"] = "否"
-- en: "Show unchanged"
L["Show unchanged"] = "顯示未變更項目"
-- en: "Changed fields: %d"
