-- en: "Select a profile in the sidebar to inspect it, then Activate profile to switch. New and Duplicate open a named draft with Apply and Cancel. Import stages a validated new profile; Compare shows setting differences. Copy and Reset replace the active profile after confirmation; the red trash deletes an inactive profile."
L["Select a profile in the sidebar to inspect it, then Activate profile to switch. New and Duplicate open a named draft with Apply and Cancel. Import stages a validated new profile; Compare shows setting differences. Copy and Reset replace the active profile after confirmation; the red trash deletes an inactive profile."] = "在側邊欄中選擇一個設定檔以檢視，然後點擊「啟用設定檔」進行切換。「新增」與「複製」會開啟一個帶有「套用」與「取消」的命名草稿。「匯入」會暫存一個經過驗證的新設定檔；「比較」會顯示設定差異。「從設定檔複製」與「重設」在確認後會取代目前使用中的設定檔；紅色垃圾桶會刪除一個未使用的設定檔。"
-- en: "Select an effect to edit its name, type and type-specific settings. The icon previews it live. Sequence sections edit animation, color, pulse or custom frames in order. Duplicate creates an independent effect. Drag a sequence card surface to reorder it; fields remain editable. New effects can be configured before naming. Apply saves the draft; Cancel discards it. Import stages a validated replacement."
L["Select an effect to edit its name, type and type-specific settings. The icon previews it live. Sequence sections edit animation, color, pulse or custom frames in order. Duplicate creates an independent effect. Drag a sequence card surface to reorder it; fields remain editable. New effects can be configured before naming. Apply saves the draft; Cancel discards it. Import stages a validated replacement."] = "選擇一個效果以編輯其名稱、類型及該類型特有的設定。圖示會即時預覽效果。序列部分依序編輯動畫、顏色、脈衝或自訂影格。「複製」會建立一個獨立的效果。拖曳序列卡片的表面可重新排序；欄位仍可編輯。新效果可以在命名前先進行設定。「套用」會儲存草稿；「取消」會捨棄它。「匯入」會暫存一個經過驗證的取代項目。"
-- en: "Settings changed elsewhere. Cancel to reload them before applying."
