L["Custom Lua has the same access as the addon. Only import code you trust. Syntax validation cannot establish that a callback is safe or correct. Existing custom widget callbacks still use their original UI contract."] = "自訂 Lua 擁有與插件相同的存取權限。只匯入你信任的程式碼。語法驗證無法確定回呼是否安全或正確。現有的自訂元件回呼仍使用其原有的介面約定。"
-- en: "Declare named fields, primitive types, nested records and unions. Example: { spell = { string, number }, unit = string, tests = condition[] }. Schema text is parsed as data and never evaluated as Lua."
L["Declare named fields, primitive types, nested records and unions. Example: { spell = { string, number }, unit = string, tests = condition[] }. Schema text is parsed as data and never evaluated as Lua."] = "宣告命名欄位、基本型別、巢狀記錄與聯合型別。範例：{ spell = { string, number }, unit = string, tests = condition[] }。結構文字會作為資料解析，從不作為 Lua 執行。"
