-- en: "Function tabs edit separate callbacks. Changes stay in a draft. Check syntax compiles every callback without running it. Apply registers the callbacks and can run registration code. Cancel discards the draft. Undo and Redo work across function tabs."
L["Function tabs edit separate callbacks. Changes stay in a draft. Check syntax compiles every callback without running it. Apply registers the callbacks and can run registration code. Cancel discards the draft. Undo and Redo work across function tabs."] = "各函式分頁分別編輯不同的回呼。變更會保存在草稿中。「檢查語法」會編譯每個回呼但不執行它們。「套用」會註冊這些回呼，並可能執行註冊程式碼。「取消」會捨棄草稿。復原與重做可跨函式分頁使用。"
