-- en: "On unregister"
L["On unregister"] = "取消註冊時"
-- en: "Summary"
L["Summary"] = "摘要"
-- en: "Syntax checked. No custom code was executed."
L["Syntax checked. No custom code was executed."] = "語法已檢查。未執行任何自訂程式碼。"
-- en: "The custom condition changed elsewhere. Reopen it before saving."
L["The custom condition changed elsewhere. Reopen it before saving."] = "此自訂條件已在別處變更。儲存前請重新開啟它。"
-- en: "Trusted code"
L["Trusted code"] = "受信任的程式碼"
-- en: "Validate"
L["Validate"] = "驗證"
-- en: "All tags"
L["All tags"] = "所有標籤"
-- en: "Edit the description, tags, author, realm, email, website and version. Source citations remain separate from your attribution. Use changes updates the rotation draft; Apply the rotation to save it. Cancel or Escape restores this dialog’s opening values."
L["Edit the description, tags, author, realm, email, website and version. Source citations remain separate from your attribution. Use changes updates the rotation draft; Apply the rotation to save it. Cancel or Escape restores this dialog’s opening values."] = "編輯說明、標籤、作者、伺服器、電子郵件、網站與版本。來源引用與你的署名分開保存。「使用變更」會更新循環草稿；套用循環以儲存。「取消」或 Esc 鍵會還原此對話框開啟時的值。"
-- en: "Invalid tags. Use up to 64 tags of 64 characters, separated by commas."
L["Invalid tags. Use up to 64 tags of 64 characters, separated by commas."] = "標籤無效。最多可使用 64 個標籤，每個最多 64 個字元，以逗號分隔。"
-- en: "Separate tags with commas. Use quotes for tags containing commas. Any personal label is allowed."
L["Separate tags with commas. Use quotes for tags containing commas. Any personal label is allowed."] = "用逗號分隔標籤。包含逗號的標籤請使用引號。允許任何個人標籤。"
-- en: "Tags"
L["Tags"] = "標籤"
-- en: "Switch priority"
L["Switch priority"] = "切換優先順序"
-- en: "Priority %d"
L["Priority %d"] = "優先順序 %d"
-- en: "Invalid priority"
L["Invalid priority"] = "無效的優先順序"
-- en: "Switch priority must be a whole number between -100000 and 100000."
L["Switch priority must be a whole number between -100000 and 100000."] = "切換優先順序必須是 -100000 到 100000 之間的整數。"
-- en: "Edit the description, tags, switch priority, author, realm, email, website and version. Source citations remain separate from your attribution. Use changes updates the rotation draft; Apply the rotation to save it. Cancel or Escape restores this dialog’s opening values."
L["Edit the description, tags, switch priority, author, realm, email, website and version. Source citations remain separate from your attribution. Use changes updates the rotation draft; Apply the rotation to save it. Cancel or Escape restores this dialog’s opening values."] = "編輯說明、標籤、切換優先順序、作者、伺服器、電子郵件、網站與版本。來源引用與你的署名分開保存。「使用變更」會更新循環草稿；套用循環以儲存。「取消」或 Esc 鍵會還原此對話框開啟時的值。"
-- en: "Higher priority wins within custom or Built In rotations. Custom rotations and a valid saved fallback take precedence over Built In rotations. Equal priorities use name, then identity. Blank means zero."
L["Higher priority wins within custom or Built In rotations. Custom rotations and a valid saved fallback take precedence over Built In rotations. Equal priorities use name, then identity. Blank means zero."] = "在自訂循環或內建循環內部，優先順序較高者勝出。自訂循環與有效的已儲存備用循環優先於內建循環。優先順序相同時依序依名稱、識別排序。留空表示零。"
-- en: "Invalid switch priority for %s:%s; explicit repair resets it to zero."
L["Invalid switch priority for %s:%s; explicit repair resets it to zero."] = "%s:%s 的切換優先順序無效；明確修復會將其重設為零。"
-- en: "Match all ranks"
L["Match all ranks"] = "比對所有等級"
-- en: "%s (any rank)"
L["%s (any rank)"] = "%s（任意等級）"
-- en: "For a numeric spell selection, also recognize auras with the same readable localized spell name. Exact IDs remain the default. Spell names already match by name. Unavailable metadata or restricted aura identity stays unavailable, including under NOT. Different spells sharing a name can match; use exact IDs when that distinction matters."
L["For a numeric spell selection, also recognize auras with the same readable localized spell name. Exact IDs remain the default. Spell names already match by name. Unavailable metadata or restricted aura identity stays unavailable, including under NOT. Different spells sharing a name can match; use exact IDs when that distinction matters."] = "對於以數字指定的法術，也辨識具有相同可讀在地化法術名稱的光環。預設仍為精確 ID。依名稱指定的法術本來就依名稱比對。無法使用的中繼資料或受限的光環身分維持為無法使用，在 NOT 下同樣如此。同名的不同法術可能會符合；當這種區別很重要時，請使用精確 ID。"
-- en: "Talent tree %s"
L["Talent tree %s"] = "天賦樹 %s"
-- en: "This client does not expose a Classic talent-tree layout. The saved tree reference is preserved."
L["This client does not expose a Classic talent-tree layout. The saved tree reference is preserved."] = "此用戶端未提供經典版天賦樹配置。已儲存的天賦樹參照會被保留。"
-- en: "Talent tree"
L["Talent tree"] = "天賦樹"
-- en: "Talent Tree Points"
L["Talent Tree Points"] = "天賦樹點數"
-- en: "points spent in %s"
L["points spent in %s"] = "%s中投入的點數"
-- en: "Talent tree selects the Classic tree whose spent points are compared. Public points are read again on the next evaluation; missing or restricted points are unavailable, including under NOT. Grids and trait trees are unsupported."
L["Talent tree selects the Classic tree whose spent points are compared. Public points are read again on the next evaluation; missing or restricted points are unavailable, including under NOT. Grids and trait trees are unsupported."] = "「天賦樹」選擇要比較已投入點數的經典版天賦樹。公開點數會在下一次評估時重新讀取；缺少或受限的點數為無法使用，在 NOT 下同樣如此。不支援網格天賦與特質樹。"
-- en: "Compare whole points spent from zero to 512. An explicit comparison with zero can describe an unspent tree."
L["Compare whole points spent from zero to 512. An explicit comparison with zero can describe an unspent tree."] = "比較已投入的整數點數，範圍為 0 到 512。明確與零比較可用來描述未投點的天賦樹。"
-- en: "Primary Talent Tree"
L["Primary Talent Tree"] = "主要天賦樹"
-- en: "your primary talent tree is %s"
L["your primary talent tree is %s"] = "你的主要天賦樹為%s"
-- en: "Talent tree selects the unique Classic tree with the most positive spent points. Equal maxima, no spent points, missing records and restricted points are unavailable, including under NOT."
L["Talent tree selects the unique Classic tree with the most positive spent points. Equal maxima, no spent points, missing records and restricted points are unavailable, including under NOT."] = "「天賦樹」選擇投入點數最多（且大於零）的唯一經典版天賦樹。最大值相同、未投入點數、記錄缺少與受限點數均為無法使用，在 NOT 下同樣如此。"
-- en: "The primary tree is derived from readable points, not the saved rotation slot. Hybrid builds may need tree-point or individual-talent conditions instead; the primary tree does not assign a tank or healer role. Grids and trait trees are unsupported."
L["The primary tree is derived from readable points, not the saved rotation slot. Hybrid builds may need tree-point or individual-talent conditions instead; the primary tree does not assign a tank or healer role. Grids and trait trees are unsupported."] = "主要天賦樹由可讀的點數推算得出，而不是已儲存的循環欄位。混合天賦配置可能需要改用天賦樹點數或單一天賦條件；主要天賦樹不會指定坦克或治療職責。不支援網格天賦與特質樹。"
-- en: "Item sets are checked in priority order. Bag counts use the first carried candidate, not the sum. Availability, range and cooldown checks use the first carried or equipped candidate. Missing or restricted observations stay unavailable, including under NOT."
L["Item sets are checked in priority order. Bag counts use the first carried candidate, not the sum. Availability, range and cooldown checks use the first carried or equipped candidate. Missing or restricted observations stay unavailable, including under NOT."] = "物品組依優先順序檢查。背包數量使用第一個攜帶的候選物品，而不是總和。可用性、距離與冷卻檢查使用第一個攜帶或已裝備的候選物品。缺少或受限的觀測維持為無法使用，在 NOT 下同樣如此。"
-- en: "Item Available checks the required level and enabled item cooldown. An active cooldown qualifies only when it ends with the readable global cooldown. This condition does not bypass the action's implicit ownership, usability and range checks."
L["Item Available checks the required level and enabled item cooldown. An active cooldown qualifies only when it ends with the readable global cooldown. This condition does not bypass the action's implicit ownership, usability and range checks."] = "「物品可用」會檢查所需等級與已啟用的物品冷卻。只有當冷卻隨可讀的共用冷卻一同結束時，正在進行的冷卻才算符合。此條件不會繞過動作隱含的擁有、可用性與距離檢查。"
-- en: "Diagram view"
L["Diagram view"] = "圖表檢視"
-- en: "List view"
L["List view"] = "清單檢視"
-- en: "Switch between the diagram and compact tree list. This changes only the view."
L["Switch between the diagram and compact tree list. This changes only the view."] = "在圖表與精簡的樹狀清單之間切換。這只會改變檢視。"
-- en: "Zoom out"
L["Zoom out"] = "縮小"
-- en: "Zoom in"
L["Zoom in"] = "放大"
-- en: "Reset canvas zoom to 100%. Drag empty canvas space to pan. Window scale is unchanged."
L["Reset canvas zoom to 100%. Drag empty canvas space to pan. Window scale is unchanged."] = "將畫布縮放重設為 100%。拖曳畫布空白處可平移。視窗縮放保持不變。"
-- en: "Navigating rotations"
L["Navigating rotations"] = "瀏覽循環"
-- en: "Diagram / List changes only the rotation view; General settings choose the default. Diagram has floating minus, percentage and plus controls at the bottom right. Scroll to zoom from 25% to 200%; click the percentage or middle-click to reset to 100%. Drag empty diagram space to pan. List uses normal scrollbars with touching cards and boxed branch arms, False before True. Cooldowns use a separate scrolling grid. Dragging cards reorders them in every view. Each workspace currently shows at most 200 cards; the remaining saved cards are preserved."
L["Diagram / List changes only the rotation view; General settings choose the default. Diagram has floating minus, percentage and plus controls at the bottom right. Scroll to zoom from 25% to 200%; click the percentage or middle-click to reset to 100%. Drag empty diagram space to pan. List uses normal scrollbars with touching cards and boxed branch arms, False before True. Cooldowns use a separate scrolling grid. Dragging cards reorders them in every view. Each workspace currently shows at most 200 cards; the remaining saved cards are preserved."] = "「圖表 / 清單」只改變循環檢視；預設檢視在一般設定中選擇。圖表檢視右下角有浮動的減號、百分比與加號控制項。捲動滾輪可在 25% 到 200% 之間縮放；點擊百分比或按滑鼠中鍵可重設為 100%。拖曳圖表空白處可平移。清單檢視使用一般捲軸，卡片緊密相連，分支以方框顯示，「假」在「真」之前。冷卻使用另外的可捲動網格。在任一檢視中拖曳卡片都可重新排序。每個工作區目前最多顯示 200 張卡片；其餘已儲存的卡片會被保留。"
-- en: "Enabled / Disabled"
L["Enabled / Disabled"] = "啟用 / 停用"
-- en: "Announcement substitutions"
L["Announcement substitutions"] = "通報替換變數"
-- en: "New, Duplicate, Import/Export and Compare"
L["New, Duplicate, Import/Export and Compare"] = "新增、複製、匯入/匯出與比較"
-- en: "Announcement details stay always expanded while editing. Press Enter or leave a text field to stage its value; Apply saves the draft. Invalid fields must be corrected before Apply; Discard abandons pending changes. Searchable selectors open on click and filter as you type. The page Help icon explains every option and text substitution."
L["Help.Announces.editing"] = "編輯時通報詳情始終保持展開。按 Enter 或離開文字欄位即可暫存其值；「套用」會儲存草稿。無效欄位必須在套用前更正；「捨棄」會丟棄待處理的變更。可搜尋的選擇器在點擊時開啟，並隨輸入進行篩選。頁面上的說明圖示會解釋每個選項與文字替換變數。"
-- en: "Announce selected spell casts or item uses independently of your active rotation, or invoke a configured Via Script/Macro entry directly. Select an entry in the sidebar, or use New to prepare one. The trigger applies to every ordered output card; each card has its own destination and conditions. These settings do not cast spells or use items. Cast-triggered announcements follow RM's combat-data policy and do not run on reference-only clients."
L["Help.Announces.overview"] = "獨立於目前循環，通報選定的法術施放或物品使用，或直接呼叫已設定的「透過指令碼/巨集」項目。在側邊欄中選擇一個項目，或使用「新增」來準備一個。觸發器適用於每一張有序的輸出卡片；每張卡片都有自己的目標與條件。這些設定不會施放法術或使用物品。由施法觸發的通報遵循 RM 的戰鬥資料政策，不會在僅供參考的用戶端上執行。"
-- en: "An optional name identifies this announcement in the sidebar. Without one, the action name or Via Script/Macro identifier is used. Changing this display name does not change the watched action or callable identifier."
L["Help.Announces.name"] = "選擇性的名稱用於在側邊欄中識別此通報。若未填寫，則使用動作名稱或「透過指令碼/巨集」的識別碼。變更此顯示名稱不會改變所監視的動作或可呼叫的識別碼。"
-- en: "Choose Spell, Pet Spell, Item or Via Script/Macro. Changing type clears the previous action and exact-rank choice. Via Script/Macro uses an Identifier instead of a cast event or stored action; switching back restores the event selector. Choosing the current type keeps its fields."
L["Help.Announces.type"] = "選擇「法術」「寵物法術」「物品」或「透過指令碼/巨集」。變更類型會清除之前的動作與精確等級選擇。「透過指令碼/巨集」使用識別碼，而不是施法事件或已儲存的動作；切換回來會還原事件選擇器。選擇目前類型會保留其欄位。"
-- en: "Watch one of your spells. Choose the spell in the searchable field below Action Type."
L["Help.Announces.type.spell"] = "監視你的某個法術。在「動作類型」下方的可搜尋欄位中選擇該法術。"
-- en: "Watch a spell from your pet spellbook. The spell selector uses the pet catalog for this action type."
L["Help.Announces.type.pet"] = "監視你寵物法術書中的某個法術。對此動作類型，法術選擇器使用寵物法術目錄。"
-- en: "Watch item-use spells from a reusable item set or a custom list. This is an announcement trigger; it does not choose an item to use for you."
L["Help.Announces.type.item"] = "監視來自可重複使用物品組或自訂清單的物品使用法術。這是通報的觸發器；它不會替你選擇要使用的物品。"
-- en: "Search by spell name, select a result, or drag a spell from your spellbook or action bar into the field. The icon and name identify the selected spell. Spell and pet spell choices keep their respective catalog scope."
L["Help.Announces.spell"] = "依法術名稱搜尋並選擇結果，或從法術書或快捷列將法術拖入該欄位。圖示與名稱標示所選法術。法術與寵物法術的選擇各自保持其目錄範圍。"
-- en: "Checked limits matching to the selected rank. Unchecked includes the known ranks in that spell family. This checkbox is shown only for Spell and Pet Spell."
L["Help.Announces.ranked"] = "勾選後只比對所選等級。未勾選時包含該法術系列中已知的所有等級。此核取方塊僅在「法術」與「寵物法術」中顯示。"
-- en: "Choose a reusable set, or Custom to edit this announcement's own list. For a custom list, search for or drag items into the fields; Add item appends one and a red trash can removes an entry. Any matching item-use spell in the list can trigger the announcement; list order does not limit announcements to the first carried item. Changes to a shared set belong on the Item Sets page."
L["Help.Announces.items"] = "選擇一個可重複使用的物品組，或選擇「自訂」以編輯此通報自己的清單。對於自訂清單，可在欄位中搜尋或拖入物品；「新增物品」會附加一項，紅色垃圾桶會移除一項。清單中任何相符的物品使用法術都可以觸發通報；清單順序不會將通報限制為第一個攜帶的物品。對共用物品組的變更應在「物品組」頁面中進行。"
-- en: "For automatic action types, choose which observed cast event triggers this entry. A start, stop, interruption, failure or delay is different from a successful cast. Client support determines which events and observations are available. Via Script/Macro has no cast event."
L["Help.Announces.event"] = "對於自動動作類型，選擇由哪種觀測到的施法事件觸發此項目。開始、停止、中斷、失敗或延遲都不同於施法成功。用戶端的支援程度決定了可用的事件與觀測。「透過指令碼/巨集」沒有施法事件。"
-- en: "The cast or channel started. This event does not mean it will finish successfully."
L["Help.Announces.event.START"] = "施法或引導已開始。此事件並不代表它會成功完成。"
-- en: "The cast or channel stopped. A stop alone does not establish whether it succeeded."
L["Help.Announces.event.STOP"] = "施法或引導已停止。僅憑停止無法確定其是否成功。"
-- en: "The client reported a successful spell cast or item-use spell. For a channel, this can occur as channeling begins rather than after its final tick."
L["Help.Announces.event.SUCCEEDED"] = "用戶端回報法術施放或物品使用法術成功。對於引導法術，這可能在引導開始時發生，而不是在最後一跳之後。"
-- en: "The client reported that the cast was interrupted. This can include cancelling a cast yourself."
L["Help.Announces.event.INTERRUPTED"] = "用戶端回報施法被中斷。這可能包括你自己取消施法。"
-- en: "The client reported that the cast failed. This is separate from the successful-cast event."
L["Help.Announces.event.FAILED"] = "用戶端回報施法失敗。這與施法成功事件是分開的。"
-- en: "The client reported a delay to the cast. This event is not a completion or success notification."
L["Help.Announces.event.DELAYED"] = "用戶端回報施法被延遲。此事件不是完成或成功的通知。"
-- en: "Choose a chat destination, local output, a named Emote or Audible. Emote replaces Text with an emote selector and optional recipient. Audible replaces Text with Sound. Text is retained when switching modes. Say, Yell, Whisper and named joined channels are offered only for Via Script/Macro and remain subject to native restrictions."
L["Help.Announces.announce"] = "選擇一個聊天目標、本地輸出、命名表情動作或音效。「表情動作」會以表情動作選擇器與選擇性的對象取代文字。「音效」會以音效選擇取代文字。切換模式時文字會被保留。「說」「大喊」「悄悄話」與已加入的命名頻道僅在「透過指令碼/巨集」中提供，並仍受遊戲原生限制。"
-- en: "Play the selected sound locally on the Master audio channel; no chat message is sent. Choose an available sound before applying the announcement."
L["Help.Announces.channel.audible"] = "在主音訊通道上本地播放所選音效；不會傳送聊天訊息。套用通報前請選擇一個可用的音效。"
-- en: "Use raid chat while in a raid, party chat while in a party, or your local chat frame while solo."
L["Help.Announces.channel.partyraid"] = "在團隊中時使用團隊聊天，在隊伍中時使用隊伍聊天，單人時使用你的本地聊天框。"
-- en: "Use party chat when grouped, including your party within a raid. This destination produces no solo chat message."
L["Help.Announces.channel.party"] = "組隊時使用隊伍聊天，包括你在團隊中所在的小隊。此目標在單人時不會產生聊天訊息。"
-- en: "Request group warning output. Depending on group membership and permissions, RM may use raid chat, party chat, or local output instead."
L["Help.Announces.channel.raidwarn"] = "請求以隊伍警告的方式輸出。根據隊伍成員身分與權限，RM 可能會改用團隊聊天、隊伍聊天或本地輸出。"
-- en: "A saved free-text emote keeps its original message. Select Emote to use a named client emote instead."
L["Help.Announces.channel.emote"] = "已儲存的自由文字表情動作會保留其原始訊息。選擇「表情動作」可改用用戶端的命名表情動作。"
-- en: "Custom emote"
L["Custom emote"] = "自訂表情動作"
-- en: "Use spell recipient ({{target}})"
L["Use spell recipient ({{target}})"] = "使用法術對象（{{target}}）"
-- en: "Automatic Say and Yell are unavailable. Choose another announcement destination."
L["Automatic Say and Yell are unavailable. Choose another announcement destination."] = "自動「說」與「大喊」無法使用。請選擇其他通報目標。"
-- en: "Choose a named emote from this client's slash commands, such as /cheer. This does not send the Text field as a custom emote."
L["Help.Announces.channel.gesture"] = "從此用戶端的斜線指令中選擇一個命名表情動作，例如 /cheer。這不會將「文字」欄位作為自訂表情動作傳送。"
-- en: "Choose the emote to perform when the configured cast event is observed. The client may restrict an emote or require a hardware action; RM does not retry through another output path."
L["Help.Announces.emote"] = "選擇觀測到所設定的施法事件時要執行的表情動作。用戶端可能會限制某個表情動作或要求實體按鍵操作；RM 不會透過其他輸出途徑重試。"
-- en: "For cast entries, checked directs the emote to the recipient recorded for this exact cast, including click casting. It does not use your current target or a previous cast's recipient. For Via Script/Macro, checked uses the supplied macro unit. A missing recipient skips targeted output. Unchecked performs the emote without a target."
L["Help.Announces.emote_target"] = "對於施法項目，勾選後會將表情動作指向為這次施法記錄的對象，包括點擊施法。它不會使用你目前的目標或之前施法的對象。對於「透過指令碼/巨集」，勾選後會使用巨集提供的單位。缺少對象時會略過指向性輸出。未勾選時會在沒有目標的情況下執行表情動作。"
-- en: "Write to your own chat frame. Other players do not receive this message."
L["Help.Announces.channel.local"] = "寫入你自己的聊天框。其他玩家不會收到此訊息。"
-- en: "Enter the message for a chat destination. The substitutions below insert action and cast information when it is available. This text is not used for Audible or named Emote output."
L["Help.Announces.text"] = "輸入要傳送到聊天目標的訊息。下方的替換變數會在可用時插入動作與施法資訊。此文字不用於音效或命名表情動作輸出。"
-- en: "For cast entries, {{spell}} is a spell link, {{item}} an item link and {{event}} the localized event name. {{target}} uses the recorded cast target, with the last recorded target for that spell as a fallback; it does not automatically use your selected target or your name. Unavailable cast substitutions can remain unchanged. Via Script/Macro instead uses its supplied target and spell, {{event}} becomes Via Script/Macro, and required missing inputs skip output; this API supplies no {{item}}."
L["Help.Announces.substitutions"] = "對於施法項目，{{spell}} 是法術連結，{{item}} 是物品連結，{{event}} 是在地化的事件名稱。{{target}} 使用記錄的施法目標，並以該法術最後一次記錄的目標作為備用；它不會自動使用你選取的目標或你的名字。無法使用的施法替換變數可能保持原樣。「透過指令碼/巨集」則使用其提供的目標與法術，{{event}} 會變為「透過指令碼/巨集」，缺少必要的輸入時會略過輸出；此 API 不提供 {{item}}。"
-- en: "Choose a sound supplied by the shared-media catalog, then click Play to preview it. Preview is local and does not save the draft. An unavailable sound cannot be previewed; Audible announcements require a nonempty sound selection."
L["Help.Announces.sound"] = "選擇共用媒體目錄提供的音效，然後點擊「播放」進行預覽。預覽只在本地進行，不會儲存草稿。無法使用的音效無法預覽；音效通報需要選擇一個非空的音效。"
-- en: "The pill turns this entry on or off while keeping its fields. Disabled entries do not announce matching casts or macro invocations. Apply saves the changed state."
L["Help.Announces.state"] = "該開關可在保留欄位的同時啟用或停用此項目。已停用的項目不會通報相符的施法或巨集呼叫。「套用」會儲存變更後的狀態。"
-- en: "Edits stay in a draft until Apply. Complete the action or Via Script/Macro identifier and other required fields before saving. Discard abandons changes to saved announcements; Cancel closes a new creation draft. Leaving pending changes offers Apply, Discard or Cancel navigation."
L["Help.Announces.save"] = "編輯內容會保留為草稿，直到按下「套用」。儲存前請完成動作或「透過指令碼/巨集」的識別碼以及其他必填欄位。「捨棄」會丟棄對已儲存通報的變更；「取消」會關閉新建的草稿。有待處理的變更時離開頁面，會提供「套用」「捨棄」或「取消」選項。"
-- en: "Use the sidebar buttons to create, duplicate, transfer or compare announcements. Apply saves the imported draft; Compare does not merge entries. Via Script/Macro Duplicate assigns a distinct identifier and every copied output gets a fresh identity. Series exports use version 2; version 1 remains available for legacy single-output entries. Imports and Apply reject ambiguous identifiers. The red trash permanently deletes the selected saved entry after confirmation. Resolve pending edits first; deletion does not carry into the next selected draft."
L["Help.Announces.collections"] = "使用側邊欄按鈕來新增、複製、傳輸或比較通報。「套用」會儲存匯入的草稿；「比較」不會合併項目。複製「透過指令碼/巨集」項目時會指派一個不同的識別碼，且每個複製的輸出都會獲得新的身分。系列匯出使用版本 2；版本 1 仍可用於舊版單一輸出項目。匯入與套用會拒絕含義不明確的識別碼。紅色垃圾桶會在確認後永久刪除所選的已儲存項目。請先處理待處理的編輯；刪除操作不會延續到下一個選取的草稿。"
-- en: "Press Enter or leave a text field to stage its value; Apply saves the draft. Invalid text stays red and blocks navigation until corrected. Searchable selectors open on click and filter as you type. Section headings collapse or expand their contents."
L["Press Enter or leave a text field to stage its value; Apply saves the draft. Invalid text stays red and blocks navigation until corrected. Searchable selectors open on click and filter as you type. Section headings collapse or expand their contents."] = "按 Enter 或離開文字欄位即可暫存其值；「套用」會儲存草稿。無效文字會維持紅色，並在更正前阻止頁面切換。可搜尋的選擇器在點擊時開啟，並隨輸入進行篩選。分節標題可摺疊或展開其內容。"
-- en: "An item set is an ordered list of alternatives, such as different mana potions. Runtime selection checks the list from the top for a carried or, where requested, equipped item. Priority comes from the order you choose, not the item level. Selecting an item does not by itself prove that it is usable, off cooldown, or in range; action readiness is checked separately."
L["Help.ItemSets.overview"] = "物品組是一個有序的備選物品清單，例如不同的法力藥水。執行時會從清單頂端開始，尋找攜帶的（或在要求時已裝備的）物品。優先順序取決於你所設的順序，而不是物品等級。選中某件物品本身並不證明它可用、已冷卻完畢或在距離內；動作是否就緒會另外檢查。"
-- en: "Name the selected set so it can be found in the sidebar and referenced by rotations or conditions. New opens a name form; its first Apply saves an empty named set. Add items afterward and Apply again to save them. Discarding later item edits keeps that already saved set. Renaming a set does not change its identity in saved references."
L["Help.ItemSets.name"] = "為所選物品組命名，以便在側邊欄中找到它，並供循環或條件參照。「新增」會開啟名稱表單；第一次「套用」會儲存一個空的命名物品組。之後新增物品並再次「套用」以儲存它們。捨棄之後的物品編輯會保留已儲存的物品組。重新命名物品組不會改變它在已儲存參照中的身分。"
-- en: "Checked stores this set in the shared global collection, available to other profiles and characters using this addon database. Unchecked stores it in the current profile, which can itself be shared by characters. This is a staged move; Apply saves it. A profile set takes precedence if a global set has the same saved identity."
L["Help.ItemSets.global"] = "勾選後會將此物品組儲存在共用的全域集合中，供使用此插件資料庫的其他設定檔與角色使用。未勾選時會儲存在目前設定檔中，而設定檔本身也可被多個角色共用。這是一項暫存的移動；「套用」會儲存它。若全域物品組與設定檔物品組具有相同的已儲存身分，則設定檔物品組優先。"
-- en: "The list of item cards is the priority order. Put preferred items first. RM can leave a selection unavailable when required inventory or identity observations are missing; it does not treat unknown data as proof that a lower-priority item should be used. The sidebar icon represents the first defined item and need not be the currently carried or highlighted one."
L["Help.ItemSets.items"] = "物品卡片清單即為優先順序。請將首選物品放在前面。當缺少所需的背包或身分觀測時，RM 可能會讓選擇維持為無法使用；它不會把未知資料當作應使用較低優先順序物品的證據。側邊欄圖示代表第一個定義的物品，不一定是目前攜帶或被醒目提示的物品。"
-- en: "Search by item name and choose a result, or drag an item from your bags or action bar into its field. The icon identifies the item; metadata can take time to load. Edit a row to replace that entry. Use its red trash can to remove it rather than clearing a required item field."
L["Help.ItemSets.item"] = "依物品名稱搜尋並選擇結果，或從背包或快捷列將物品拖入其欄位。圖示標示該物品；中繼資料可能需要一些時間載入。編輯某一列可取代該項目。要移除時請使用其紅色垃圾桶，而不是清除必填的物品欄位。"
-- en: "Choose or drag an item into the empty item field above the list, then click Add item to append it to the priority list, or drag Add item into a gap between cards to insert it there. Entering an item in this field alone does not add a row."
L["Help.ItemSets.add"] = "在清單上方的空物品欄位中選擇或拖入一件物品，然後點擊「新增物品」將其附加到優先順序清單，或將「新增物品」拖入卡片之間的空隙以在該處插入。僅在此欄位中輸入物品並不會新增一列。"
-- en: "Move Up / Move Down"
L["Move Up / Move Down"] = "上移 / 下移"
-- en: "Use the arrows on the left, or drag an item row into a highlighted insertion gap. Ctrl-drag moves that row and all following entries together. The floating preview identifies what you are moving. Moves past the beginning or end are unavailable. Reordering changes priority and stays in the draft until Apply."
L["Help.ItemSets.order"] = "使用左側的箭頭，或將物品列拖入醒目標示的插入空隙。按住 Ctrl 拖曳會將該列及其後所有項目一起移動。浮動預覽會標示你正在移動的內容。超出開頭或結尾的移動無法執行。重新排序會改變優先順序，並在按下「套用」前保留在草稿中。"
-- en: "Bind / Unbind"
L["Bind / Unbind"] = "綁定 / 解除綁定"
-- en: "Outside combat, apply pending item-set edits before binding. Drag the set (its row in the list, or the Bind pill) onto any action bar slot; an occupied slot swaps, leaving its previous action on the cursor. Or click Bind and then click an empty slot. Both pick up the first available item of the set. RM records the slot and updates it as item availability changes. The pill shows bound slot numbers; click it to unbind and remove still-matching bar items. Replaced bar actions are preserved. Binding changes are immediate action-bar operations, independent of the draft and its history."
L["Help.ItemSets.binding"] = "在非戰鬥狀態下，綁定前請先套用待處理的物品組編輯。將物品組（清單中的對應列，或「綁定」標籤）拖曳到任一快捷列欄位上；已被佔用的欄位會交換，原有動作會留在游標上。或者點擊「綁定」後再點擊一個空欄位。兩種方式都會拿起該物品組中第一件可用的物品。RM 會記錄該欄位，並在物品可用性變化時更新它。該標籤會顯示已綁定的欄位編號；點擊它可解除綁定，並移除快捷列上仍相符的物品。被取代的快捷列動作會被保留。綁定的變更是立即生效的快捷列操作，獨立於草稿及其歷史。"
-- en: "Restore the packaged item list for this set. Reset is available only for a set with a packaged default. The restored list is staged until Apply; the name is kept."
L["Help.ItemSets.reset"] = "還原此物品組的內建物品清單。僅當物品組有內建預設值時才可重設。還原的清單會暫存至按下「套用」；名稱保持不變。"
-- en: "The red trash can at the top right permanently removes the selected saved set after confirmation. Resolve pending edits before the final warning. References in rotations or conditions then need another set. Deletion reconciles still-matching bound bar actions and keeps the set if unbinding fails; the next selection opens without an unsaved deletion marker."
L["Help.ItemSets.delete"] = "右上角的紅色垃圾桶會在確認後永久移除所選的已儲存物品組。在最終警告前請先處理待處理的編輯。之後循環或條件中的參照需要改用其他物品組。刪除時會同步處理快捷列上仍相符的已綁定動作，如果解除綁定失敗則保留該物品組；下一個選取項目開啟時不會帶有未儲存的刪除標記。"
-- en: "Undo / Redo"
L["Undo / Redo"] = "復原 / 重做"
-- en: "Undo and Redo travel through recent item-set draft edits, including replacements, additions, ordering and row removals. They are unavailable when that direction has no history. Apply, Discard or leaving the page clears this bounded history. They do not reverse confirmed entity deletion or explicit action-bar binding operations."
L["Help.ItemSets.history"] = "復原與重做可在最近的物品組草稿編輯之間切換，包括取代、新增、排序與刪除列。當該方向沒有歷史記錄時無法使用。「套用」「捨棄」或離開頁面會清除這段有限的歷史。它們不會撤銷已確認的項目刪除或明確的快捷列綁定操作。"
-- en: "Ordinary item-set edits stay in a draft until Apply. Discard restores the saved item sets. Cancel closes a new creation draft. Leaving with pending changes offers Apply, Discard or Cancel navigation. Invalid fields must be corrected before Apply; Discard can abandon them."
L["Help.ItemSets.save"] = "一般的物品組編輯會保留為草稿，直到按下「套用」。「捨棄」會還原已儲存的物品組。「取消」會關閉新建的草稿。有待處理的變更時離開頁面，會提供「套用」「捨棄」或「取消」選項。無效欄位必須在套用前更正；「捨棄」可以丟棄它們。"
-- en: "Use the buttons below the sidebar to create, duplicate, transfer, or compare sets. Duplicate makes an independent profile copy. Import shows the source name and can create a renamed copy or replace the selected list; Apply saves the staged result. Compare inspects differences without merging or modifying either set."
L["Help.ItemSets.collections"] = "使用側邊欄下方的按鈕來新增、複製、傳輸或比較物品組。「複製」會建立一個獨立的設定檔複本。「匯入」會顯示來源名稱，並可建立一個重新命名的複本或取代所選清單；「套用」會儲存暫存的結果。「比較」會檢查差異，但不會合併或修改任何一個物品組。"
-- en: "Legacy macro buttons"
L["Legacy macro buttons"] = "舊版巨集按鈕"
-- en: "Legacy clients may allow /click to invoke an RM item-set button separately from action-bar binding. The name is RM_ followed by the set name with non-alphanumeric characters removed, then an underscore and unit token. For a set named Bandages, an example is /click [@mouseover,nodead,help] RM_Bandages_mouseover. Other unit suffixes include player, pet, target, focus, pettarget, targettarget, focustarget, and mouseovertarget. These buttons contain item-use macro lines and do not provide the same readiness or first-item guarantee as the recommendation engine. Availability is subject to the client's secure-button and macro restrictions; reference-only support does not promise executable macro buttons."
L["Help.ItemSets.macros"] = "舊版用戶端可能允許使用 /click 來呼叫 RM 的物品組按鈕，這與快捷列綁定是分開的。其名稱為 RM_ 加上去除非英數字元後的物品組名稱，再加上底線與單位代碼。對於名為 Bandages 的物品組，範例為 /click [@mouseover,nodead,help] RM_Bandages_mouseover。其他單位後綴包括 player、pet、target、focus、pettarget、targettarget、focustarget 與 mouseovertarget。這些按鈕包含物品使用的巨集指令列，不提供與建議引擎相同的就緒檢查或首件物品保證。可用性受用戶端的安全按鈕與巨集限制約束；僅供參考的支援不保證巨集按鈕可執行。"
-- en: "Search for an item or drag it into the item field or icon. Choose the result to retain its exact item identity. The icon and name may be unavailable until metadata loads. Field clearing and save behavior belong to the editor that contains this list; use Delete when you intend to remove an entry."
L["Help.ItemSets.list.item"] = "搜尋物品，或將其拖入物品欄位或圖示。選擇結果以保留其確切的物品身分。在中繼資料載入完成前，圖示與名稱可能無法使用。欄位清除與儲存行為由包含此清單的編輯器決定；要移除項目時請使用「刪除」。"
-- en: "Move this entry to the first position in the item priority list, when that control is offered."
L["Help.ItemSets.list.top"] = "在提供該控制項時，將此項目移到物品優先順序清單的第一位。"
-- en: "Move this entry one position earlier. A move before the first entry is unavailable."
L["Help.ItemSets.list.up"] = "將此項目前移一位。無法移到第一個項目之前。"
-- en: "Move this entry one position later. A move past the final entry is unavailable."
L["Help.ItemSets.list.down"] = "將此項目後移一位。無法移到最後一個項目之後。"
-- en: "Move this entry to the final position in the item priority list, when that control is offered."
L["Help.ItemSets.list.bottom"] = "在提供該控制項時，將此項目移到物品優先順序清單的最後一位。"
-- en: "Remove this entry from the list. In a draft editor this remains pending until Apply, and Discard abandons the row edit. Undo is available where the containing editor provides draft history. This differs from permanently deleting the entire set after confirmation."
L["Help.ItemSets.list.delete"] = "從清單中移除此項目。在草稿編輯器中，此操作在按下「套用」前維持待處理狀態，「捨棄」會丟棄這一列的編輯。在所屬編輯器提供草稿歷史的地方可以復原。這不同於在確認後永久刪除整個物品組。"
-- en: "Default rotation view"
L["Default rotation view"] = "預設循環檢視"
-- en: "Choose Diagram or List as the starting rotation view. This profile preference applies when opening a rotation; changing the view inside the editor does not change this setting. Cooldowns always use a scrolling grid."
L["Choose Diagram or List as the starting rotation view. This profile preference applies when opening a rotation; changing the view inside the editor does not change this setting. Cooldowns always use a scrolling grid."] = "選擇「圖表」或「清單」作為初始的循環檢視。此設定檔偏好會在開啟循環時生效；在編輯器內變更檢視不會改變此設定。冷卻總是使用可捲動的網格。"
-- en: "Reset diagram zoom to 100%. Scroll to zoom; middle-click to reset. Drag empty space to pan."
L["Reset diagram zoom to 100%. Scroll to zoom; middle-click to reset. Drag empty space to pan."] = "將圖表縮放重設為 100%。捲動滾輪可縮放；按滑鼠中鍵可重設。拖曳空白處可平移。"
-- en: "Move this and following entries"
L["Move this and following entries"] = "移動此項目及其後的項目"
-- en: "Drag one entry; Ctrl-drag moves it and all following siblings."
L["Drag one entry; Ctrl-drag moves it and all following siblings."] = "拖曳一個項目；按住 Ctrl 拖曳會移動它及其後所有同層項目。"
-- en: "%d cards"
L["%d cards"] = "%d 張卡片"
-- en: " (%d hidden)"
L[" (%d hidden)"] = "（已隱藏 %d 個）"
-- en: "Click to fold or unfold this branch arm. Other cards and conditions are unchanged."
L["Click to fold or unfold this branch arm. Other cards and conditions are unchanged."] = "點擊以摺疊或展開此分支。其他卡片與條件不受影響。"
-- en: "%s totem {{!is|is not}} active"
L["%s totem {{!is|is not}} active"] = "%s圖騰{{!正在|沒有}}生效"
-- en: "%s {{!are|are not}} %s"
L["%s {{!are|are not}} %s"] = "%s{{!是|不是}}%s"
-- en: "%s {{!are|are not}} PVP flagged"
L["%s {{!are|are not}} PVP flagged"] = "%s{{!已|未}}標記 PvP"
-- en: "%s {{!are|are not}} a %s"
L["%s {{!are|are not}} a %s"] = "%s{{!是|不是}}%s"
-- en: "%s {{!are|are not}} currently casting"
L["%s {{!are|are not}} currently casting"] = "%s{{!正在|沒有在}}施法"
-- en: "%s {{!are|are not}} currently casting %s"
L["%s {{!are|are not}} currently casting %s"] = "%s{{!正在|沒有在}}施放%s"
-- en: "{unit} {{!are|are not}} currently casting {spell}"
L["{unit} {{!are|are not}} currently casting {spell}"] = "{unit}{{!正在|沒有在}}施放{spell}"
-- en: "%s {{!are|are not}} currently channeling"
L["%s {{!are|are not}} currently channeling"] = "%s{{!正在|沒有在}}引導法術"
-- en: "%s {{!are|are not}} currently channeling %s"
L["%s {{!are|are not}} currently channeling %s"] = "%s{{!正在|沒有在}}引導%s"
-- en: "{unit} {{!are|are not}} currently channeling {spell}"
L["{unit} {{!are|are not}} currently channeling {spell}"] = "{unit}{{!正在|沒有在}}引導{spell}"
-- en: "%s {{!are|are not}} in combat"
L["%s {{!are|are not}} in combat"] = "%s{{!正在|不在}}戰鬥中"
-- en: "%s {{!has|does not have}} %s"
L["%s {{!has|does not have}} %s"] = "%s{{!擁有|沒有}}%s"
-- en: "%s {{!has|does not have}} a %s debuff"
L["%s {{!has|does not have}} a %s debuff"] = "%s{{!擁有|沒有}}%s類減益效果"
-- en: "%s {{!has|does not have}} a stealable buff"
L["%s {{!has|does not have}} a stealable buff"] = "%s{{!擁有|沒有}}可竊取的增益效果"
-- en: "%s {{!have|do not have}} %s"
L["%s {{!have|do not have}} %s"] = "%s{{!擁有|沒有}}%s"
-- en: "%s {{!have|do not have}} %s where %s"
