L["Choose a whole number of upcoming recommendations, from zero (hidden) to five. The preview shows the current priority results, not a full simulation of future cooldowns or combat. Icons start at 64 pixels; resizing scales all icons while preserving their square shape and the window ratio."] = "選擇要顯示的後續建議數量（整數），從零（隱藏）到五。預覽顯示的是目前優先順序的結果，而不是對未來冷卻或戰鬥的完整模擬。圖示初始為 64 像素；調整大小會縮放所有圖示，同時保持其正方形外觀與視窗比例。"
