-- en: "Each callback keeps its own pending text while switching tabs. Undo and Redo edit that callback buffer. Reset restores its last saved code, or the template for a new condition, and can be undone. The main Apply saves and registers all callback buffers and metadata; Discard drops the whole draft. Leaving with changes offers Apply, Discard or Cancel. Check syntax runs no callbacks."
L["Each callback keeps its own pending text while switching tabs. Undo and Redo edit that callback buffer. Reset restores its last saved code, or the template for a new condition, and can be undone. The main Apply saves and registers all callback buffers and metadata; Discard drops the whole draft. Leaving with changes offers Apply, Discard or Cancel. Check syntax runs no callbacks."] = "切換分頁時，每個回呼都會保留各自待處理的文字。復原與重做編輯的是該回呼的緩衝區。「重設」會還原其上次儲存的程式碼（或新條件的範本），且可以復原。主要的「套用」按鈕會儲存並註冊所有回呼緩衝區與中繼資料；「捨棄」會丟棄整個草稿。有變更時離開會提供「套用」「捨棄」或「取消」。「檢查語法」不執行任何回呼。"
