L["Edit fields opens a graphical schema draft. Add, name, reorder or remove fields, choose primitive or nested types, and edit nested fields. Apply stages the schema and its field order. Advanced exposes the equivalent raw schema, parsed as data without executing Lua."] = "「編輯欄位」會開啟一個圖形化的結構草稿。可新增、命名、重新排序或移除欄位，選擇基本型別或巢狀型別，並編輯巢狀欄位。「套用」會暫存結構及其欄位順序。「進階」會顯示等效的原始結構，它會作為資料解析，不會執行 Lua。"
