L["LuaWorkbench supplies editing, completion, API knowledge and debugging. Debug runs this buffer explicitly using the test arguments. It does not replace the saved rotation or live callback."] = "LuaWorkbench 提供編輯、自動完成、API 知識與偵錯功能。「偵錯」會使用測試參數明確執行此緩衝區。它不會取代已儲存的循環或實際執行中的回呼。"
