L["Filter Built In or Custom helpers and search their names, identifiers or descriptions. Packaged helpers show read-only source and typed documentation. Duplicate creates an editable copy with a new stable identifier. Argument and return rows document the Lua signature."] = "篩選內建或自訂輔助函式，並搜尋其名稱、識別碼或說明。內建輔助函式顯示唯讀原始碼與具型別的說明文件。「複製」會建立一個帶有新的穩定識別碼的可編輯複本。參數列與傳回值列記錄了 Lua 函式簽章。"
-- en: "Undo and Redo edit the Lua body. Reset restores the saved body or new-function template and can be undone. Check syntax executes no custom Lua. Apply saves the body and metadata together; Discard abandons the draft. Leaving with changes offers Apply, Discard or Cancel."
L["Undo and Redo edit the Lua body. Reset restores the saved body or new-function template and can be undone. Check syntax executes no custom Lua. Apply saves the body and metadata together; Discard abandons the draft. Leaving with changes offers Apply, Discard or Cancel."] = "復原與重做編輯 Lua 函式主體。「重設」會還原已儲存的函式主體或新函式範本，且可以復原。「檢查語法」不執行任何自訂 Lua。「套用」會同時儲存函式主體與中繼資料；「捨棄」會丟棄草稿。有變更時離開會提供「套用」「捨棄」或「取消」。"
-- en: "Expand Function bindings to add explicit helper aliases and choose their targets. Changing an alias does not rewrite your Lua body. Missing, disabled or invalid dependencies keep their dependents unavailable until repaired."
L["Expand Function bindings to add explicit helper aliases and choose their targets. Changing an alias does not rewrite your Lua body. Missing, disabled or invalid dependencies keep their dependents unavailable until repaired."] = "展開「函式綁定」可新增明確的輔助函式別名並選擇其目標。變更別名不會改寫你的 Lua 函式主體。缺少、已停用或無效的相依項目會讓相依於它們的項目在修復前維持無法使用。"
-- en: "Include custom function dependencies exports their source with the selected definition. Without it, the bundle records required helper identities and versions. Review source shows every imported Lua body. Resolve each original name and destination with Reuse, Replace or a new identifier. Apply import saves the complete reviewed bundle and can register imported Lua. Only apply code you trust."
L["Include custom function dependencies exports their source with the selected definition. Without it, the bundle records required helper identities and versions. Review source shows every imported Lua body. Resolve each original name and destination with Reuse, Replace or a new identifier. Apply import saves the complete reviewed bundle and can register imported Lua. Only apply code you trust."] = "「包含自訂函式相依項目」會將其原始碼與所選定義一同匯出。不勾選時，相依套件只記錄所需輔助函式的身分與版本。「檢查原始碼」會顯示每個匯入的 Lua 函式主體。對每個原始名稱與目標，選擇「重複使用」「取代」或使用新識別碼。「套用匯入」會儲存經過檢查的完整相依套件，並可能註冊匯入的 Lua。只套用你信任的程式碼。"
