L["Edit detached test values below. Check validates them before evaluating. Live is opt-in; test values are saved separately from the condition source."] = "在下方編輯獨立的測試值。「檢查」會先驗證再評估。「即時」需手動開啟；測試值與條件原始碼分開保存。"
