-- en: "Fields UI and Help offer an explicit Preview of the current callback. Preview uses detached sample values and the normal field or help renderer. It does not save, register, validate or evaluate the condition. Closing it releases its controls and returns to the source draft. Check syntax never runs a callback."
L["Fields UI and Help offer an explicit Preview of the current callback. Preview uses detached sample values and the normal field or help renderer. It does not save, register, validate or evaluate the condition. Closing it releases its controls and returns to the source draft. Check syntax never runs a callback."] = "「欄位介面」與「說明」提供目前回呼的明確「預覽」。預覽使用獨立的範例值以及正常的欄位或說明繪製器。它不會儲存、註冊、驗證或評估條件。關閉後會釋放其控制項並返回原始碼草稿。「檢查語法」從不執行回呼。"
-- en: "Evaluate and Validate offer Check with the same Fields UI and detached sample values. Check runs validation first, then evaluates only valid values. Results show true, false or an unavailable reason. Live is opt-in and checks at most twice per second while this panel is shown; closing stops it. Test values are saved separately and never enter condition exports or rotation edits. Source changes run no callbacks unless you check again or enable Live."
L["Evaluate and Validate offer Check with the same Fields UI and detached sample values. Check runs validation first, then evaluates only valid values. Results show true, false or an unavailable reason. Live is opt-in and checks at most twice per second while this panel is shown; closing stops it. Test values are saved separately and never enter condition exports or rotation edits. Source changes run no callbacks unless you check again or enable Live."] = "「評估」與「驗證」提供「檢查」，使用相同的欄位介面與獨立的範例值。「檢查」會先進行驗證，然後只評估有效的值。結果顯示為真、假或無法使用的原因。「即時」需手動開啟，在此面板顯示期間每秒最多檢查兩次；關閉面板即停止。測試值另外保存，永遠不會進入條件匯出或循環編輯。除非你再次檢查或啟用「即時」，否則原始碼變更不會執行任何回呼。"
-- en: "Functions reference"
L["Functions reference"] = "函式參考"
-- en: "The Functions page documents public helpers and their typed arguments, return values and source. Context completion and hover use that reference; Ctrl-click a known helper to open its source. Use explicit binding aliases for reusable custom helpers."
L["The Functions page documents public helpers and their typed arguments, return values and source. Context completion and hover use that reference; Ctrl-click a known helper to open its source. Use explicit binding aliases for reusable custom helpers."] = "「函式」頁面記錄了公用輔助函式及其具型別的參數、傳回值與原始碼。情境自動完成與滑鼠提示會使用這些參考；按住 Ctrl 點擊已知的輔助函式可開啟其原始碼。對可重複使用的自訂輔助函式，請使用明確的綁定別名。"
-- en: "The imported definition type does not match this editor."
L["The imported definition type does not match this editor."] = "匯入的定義類型與此編輯器不相符。"
-- en: "Test values changed. Check again to refresh the result."
L["Test values changed. Check again to refresh the result."] = "測試值已變更。請再次檢查以更新結果。"
-- en: "Complete the highlighted test inputs before checking."
L["Complete the highlighted test inputs before checking."] = "檢查前請先完成醒目標示的測試輸入。"
-- en: "Test"
L["Test"] = "測試"
-- en: "Run test"
L["Run test"] = "執行測試"
-- en: "Test condition"
L["Test condition"] = "測試條件"
-- en: "Debugger output"
L["Debugger output"] = "偵錯器輸出"
-- en: "Set test values in Test before debugging Evaluate."
L["Set test values in Test before debugging Evaluate."] = "偵錯「評估」前，請先在「測試」中設定測試值。"
-- en: "Debugger output uses a detached sample and the normal field or help container."
L["Debugger output uses a detached sample and the normal field or help container."] = "偵錯器輸出使用獨立的範例以及正常的欄位或說明容器。"
-- en: "Choose test values in Fields UI, then Run test to validate and evaluate. Help is shown below the fields. Opening Test does not evaluate defaults. Live is opt-in."
L["Choose test values in Fields UI, then Run test to validate and evaluate. Help is shown below the fields. Opening Test does not evaluate defaults. Live is opt-in."] = "在欄位介面中選擇測試值，然後點擊「執行測試」進行驗證與評估。說明顯示在欄位下方。開啟「測試」不會評估預設值。「即時」需手動開啟。"
-- en: "Test opens one condition-level dialog from any callback tab. It renders Fields UI and Help together with detached values. Choose the fields and Run test to validate, then evaluate only valid values. Opening the dialog does not evaluate defaults. Live is opt-in and stops when the dialog closes. Committed test values are available to the debugger and stay separate from source, exports and rotation edits. Check syntax never runs a callback."
L["Test opens one condition-level dialog from any callback tab. It renders Fields UI and Help together with detached values. Choose the fields and Run test to validate, then evaluate only valid values. Opening the dialog does not evaluate defaults. Live is opt-in and stops when the dialog closes. Committed test values are available to the debugger and stay separate from source, exports and rotation edits. Check syntax never runs a callback."] = "「測試」會從任一回呼分頁開啟一個條件層級的對話框。它會搭配獨立的測試值同時繪製欄位介面與說明。選擇欄位並點擊「執行測試」進行驗證，然後只評估有效的值。開啟對話框不會評估預設值。「即時」需手動開啟，並在對話框關閉時停止。已提交的測試值可供偵錯器使用，並與原始碼、匯出內容及循環編輯互相獨立。「檢查語法」從不執行回呼。"
-- en: "Nullable"
L["Nullable"] = "可為空"
-- en: "Add return value"
L["Add return value"] = "新增傳回值"
-- en: "Lua returns multiple values in order. Each row documents one result."
L["Lua returns multiple values in order. Each row documents one result."] = "Lua 會依序傳回多個值。每一列記錄一個結果。"
-- en: "Expand code editor"
L["Expand code editor"] = "展開程式碼編輯器"
-- en: "Restore code editor"
L["Restore code editor"] = "還原程式碼編輯器"
-- en: "Choose a source helper and the local name used to call it in this Lua body. Renaming the local name does not rewrite code. Source modules distinguish helpers with the same name."
L["Choose a source helper and the local name used to call it in this Lua body. Renaming the local name does not rewrite code. Source modules distinguish helpers with the same name."] = "選擇一個來源輔助函式，以及在此 Lua 函式主體中呼叫它時使用的區域名稱。重新命名區域名稱不會改寫程式碼。來源模組用於區分同名的輔助函式。"
-- en: "Local name in code"
L["Local name in code"] = "程式碼中的區域名稱"
-- en: "Source helper"
L["Source helper"] = "來源輔助函式"
-- en: "Function names use letters, numbers and underscores, beginning with a letter or underscore. Names suggest the local binding used to call them; registry identifiers stay stable."
L["Function names use letters, numbers and underscores, beginning with a letter or underscore. Names suggest the local binding used to call them; registry identifiers stay stable."] = "函式名稱使用字母、數字與底線，並以字母或底線開頭。名稱會作為呼叫它們時所用區域綁定的建議；登錄識別碼保持穩定。"
-- en: "This cannot be undone."
L["This cannot be undone."] = "此操作無法復原。"
-- en: "Delete this announcement?"
L["Delete this announcement?"] = "刪除此通報？"
-- en: "Type: %s"
L["Type: %s"] = "類型：%s"
-- en: "Supported unit-token to localized unit-name lookup. Use value.unit as a key; for example addon.units[value.unit]. Available tokens vary by client."
L["Supported unit-token to localized unit-name lookup. Use value.unit as a key; for example addon.units[value.unit]. Available tokens vary by client."] = "受支援的單位代碼到在地化單位名稱的查詢表。以 value.unit 作為鍵；例如 addon.units[value.unit]。可用的代碼因用戶端而異。"
-- en: "Supported unit-token to localized possessive unit-name lookup, such as your target."
L["Supported unit-token to localized possessive unit-name lookup, such as your target."] = "受支援的單位代碼到在地化所有格單位名稱（例如「你的目標的」）的查詢表。"
-- en: "Rotation Master client compatibility adapter. Its methods return ordinary readable results or nil with a reason when an observation is unavailable. Use a colon call, or pass addon.Platform explicitly as self with a dot reference."
L["Rotation Master client compatibility adapter. Its methods return ordinary readable results or nil with a reason when an observation is unavailable. Use a colon call, or pass addon.Platform explicitly as self with a dot reference."] = "Rotation Master 用戶端相容性轉接器。其方法傳回一般的可讀結果；當觀測無法使用時傳回 nil 及原因。請使用冒號呼叫，或在點號參照時明確將 addon.Platform 作為 self 傳入。"
-- en: "Rotation Master spell catalog for resolving client-specific spell IDs, ranks, names, icons and links."
L["Rotation Master spell catalog for resolving client-specific spell IDs, ranks, names, icons and links."] = "Rotation Master 法術目錄，用於解析因用戶端而異的法術 ID、等級、名稱、圖示與連結。"
-- en: "Utility functions explicitly bound to this condition or function. Choose a completion to bind an available custom function before inserting its reference."
L["Utility functions explicitly bound to this condition or function. Choose a completion to bind an available custom function before inserting its reference."] = "明確綁定到此條件或函式的工具函式。在插入其參照前，選擇一個自動完成項目以綁定可用的自訂函式。"
-- en: "Rotation Master custom function"
L["Rotation Master custom function"] = "Rotation Master 自訂函式"
-- en: "Rotation Master built-in function"
L["Rotation Master built-in function"] = "Rotation Master 內建函式"
-- en: "Rotation Master value"
L["Rotation Master value"] = "Rotation Master 值"
-- en: "Global function (documentation unavailable on this client)"
L["Global function (documentation unavailable on this client)"] = "全域函式（此用戶端上沒有說明文件）"
-- en: "This client does not provide signature documentation for this function. No arguments or return types have been inferred."
L["This client does not provide signature documentation for this function. No arguments or return types have been inferred."] = "此用戶端未提供此函式的簽章說明。未推斷任何參數或傳回型別。"
-- en: "Invoke"
L["Invoke"] = "呼叫"
-- en: "Functions are shared across profiles after Apply. Call custom utilities as functions.name(...); accepting completion adds the dependency binding. Typed calls need a binding under Function bindings. Built In examples show dot or colon explicitly."
L["Functions are shared across profiles after Apply. Call custom utilities as functions.name(...); accepting completion adds the dependency binding. Typed calls need a binding under Function bindings. Built In examples show dot or colon explicitly."] = "函式在套用後會在所有設定檔間共用。以 functions.name(...) 呼叫自訂工具函式；接受自動完成會新增相依綁定。具型別的呼叫需要在「函式綁定」下有一個綁定。內建範例會明確使用點號或冒號。"
-- en: "Show line numbers"
L["Show line numbers"] = "顯示行號"
-- en: "Line-number visibility applies to every condition and function code editor."
L["Line-number visibility applies to every condition and function code editor."] = "行號顯示設定適用於每個條件與函式的程式碼編輯器。"
-- en: "Call a saved custom utility as functions.name(...). Accepting a completion attaches its stable dependency binding; for a typed call, choose its helper under Function bindings. Existing direct aliases still work. The Invoke example shows required addon dot or colon syntax for Built In functions. Renaming an alias does not rewrite source. Missing, disabled or invalid dependencies keep consumers unavailable."
L["Call a saved custom utility as functions.name(...). Accepting a completion attaches its stable dependency binding; for a typed call, choose its helper under Function bindings. Existing direct aliases still work. The Invoke example shows required addon dot or colon syntax for Built In functions. Renaming an alias does not rewrite source. Missing, disabled or invalid dependencies keep consumers unavailable."] = "以 functions.name(...) 呼叫已儲存的自訂工具函式。接受自動完成會附加其穩定的相依綁定；對於具型別的呼叫，請在「函式綁定」下選擇其輔助函式。現有的直接別名仍可使用。「呼叫」範例展示了內建函式所需的 addon 點號或冒號語法。重新命名別名不會改寫原始碼。缺少、已停用或無效的相依項目會讓使用它們的項目維持無法使用。"
-- en: "Choose the editor for custom Lua conditions and functions. Show line numbers applies across code editors. Built In syntax highlighting and Plain text work without another addon. Automatic selects a connected provider or falls back safely. Apply saves settings; editor changes take effect on reopening, and line-number visibility updates open editors. LuaWorkbench and WowLua loading status is shown separately from integration availability."
L["Choose the editor for custom Lua conditions and functions. Show line numbers applies across code editors. Built In syntax highlighting and Plain text work without another addon. Automatic selects a connected provider or falls back safely. Apply saves settings; editor changes take effect on reopening, and line-number visibility updates open editors. LuaWorkbench and WowLua loading status is shown separately from integration availability."] = "選擇自訂 Lua 條件與函式所用的編輯器。「顯示行號」適用於所有程式碼編輯器。「內建語法突顯」與「純文字」不需其他插件即可使用。「自動」會選擇一個已連接的提供者，或安全地改用備用方案。「套用」會儲存設定；編輯器的變更在重新開啟時生效，行號顯示會更新已開啟的編輯器。LuaWorkbench 與 WowLua 的載入狀態與整合可用性分開顯示。"
-- en: "All namespaces"
L["All namespaces"] = "所有命名空間"
-- en: "Call a utility as namespace.name(...). Built In namespaces follow source files; custom functions choose their Namespace. Accepting a completion attaches its stable dependency binding; for a typed call, add its qualified name under Function bindings. Namespaces do not supply self: the Invoke example includes a method receiver explicitly, and Existing API preserves its original dot or colon spelling. Existing aliases still work. Renaming a function or namespace does not rewrite existing code or bindings. Missing, disabled or invalid dependencies keep consumers unavailable."
L["Call a utility as namespace.name(...). Built In namespaces follow source files; custom functions choose their Namespace. Accepting a completion attaches its stable dependency binding; for a typed call, add its qualified name under Function bindings. Namespaces do not supply self: the Invoke example includes a method receiver explicitly, and Existing API preserves its original dot or colon spelling. Existing aliases still work. Renaming a function or namespace does not rewrite existing code or bindings. Missing, disabled or invalid dependencies keep consumers unavailable."] = "以 namespace.name(...) 呼叫工具函式。內建命名空間與原始檔對應；自訂函式自行選擇其命名空間。接受自動完成會附加其穩定的相依綁定；對於具型別的呼叫，請在「函式綁定」下新增其完整限定名稱。命名空間不提供 self：「呼叫」範例會明確包含方法接收者，「現有 API」保留其原有的點號或冒號寫法。現有別名仍可使用。重新命名函式或命名空間不會改寫現有程式碼或綁定。缺少、已停用或無效的相依項目會讓使用它們的項目維持無法使用。"
-- en: "Choose a source helper and its name in this Lua body, such as custom.ready or utils.getCached. Namespaces are private to this callback. Renaming a binding does not rewrite code."
L["Choose a source helper and its name in this Lua body, such as custom.ready or utils.getCached. Namespaces are private to this callback. Renaming a binding does not rewrite code."] = "在此 Lua 函式主體中選擇一個來源輔助函式及其名稱，例如 custom.ready 或 utils.getCached。命名空間是此回呼私有的。重新命名綁定不會改寫程式碼。"
-- en: "Debug current buffer"
L["Debug current buffer"] = "偵錯目前緩衝區"
-- en: "Debugger terminal"
L["Debugger terminal"] = "偵錯器終端"
-- en: "Existing API"
L["Existing API"] = "現有 API"
-- en: "Name in code"
L["Name in code"] = "程式碼中的名稱"
-- en: "Namespace"
L["Namespace"] = "命名空間"
-- en: "Namespaces group functions; they do not supply a receiver. Accept a completion to bind the shown dotted call. For a typed call, add the same qualified name under Function bindings. Method examples include the required receiver explicitly. Functions are shared across profiles after Apply."
L["Namespaces group functions; they do not supply a receiver. Accept a completion to bind the shown dotted call. For a typed call, add the same qualified name under Function bindings. Method examples include the required receiver explicitly. Functions are shared across profiles after Apply."] = "命名空間用於對函式分組；它們不提供接收者。接受自動完成即可綁定所顯示的點號呼叫。對於具型別的呼叫，請在「函式綁定」下新增相同的完整限定名稱。方法範例會明確包含所需的接收者。函式在套用後會在所有設定檔間共用。"
-- en: "Play runs the current buffer once without debugging. Condition callbacks use the fields configured in Test; functions use Test arguments. Returns, printed output and full errors are available in Output. Running does not apply source changes or replace the live callback."
L["Play runs the current buffer once without debugging. Condition callbacks use the fields configured in Test; functions use Test arguments. Returns, printed output and full errors are available in Output. Running does not apply source changes or replace the live callback."] = "「播放」會在不偵錯的情況下執行一次目前緩衝區。條件回呼使用在「測試」中設定的欄位；函式使用測試參數。傳回值、列印輸出與完整錯誤可在「輸出」中檢視。執行不會套用原始碼變更，也不會取代實際執行中的回呼。"
-- en: "Private utility-function namespace. It contains only explicit bindings for this callback."
L["Private utility-function namespace. It contains only explicit bindings for this callback."] = "私有的工具函式命名空間。它只包含此回呼的明確綁定。"
-- en: "Run current buffer"
L["Run current buffer"] = "執行目前緩衝區"
-- en: "The Debug button starts a separate session and pauses at the first executable line or breakpoint. Continue resumes execution, Step over advances past the current operation, and Step into enters instrumented script functions. Native functions cannot be stepped into. Stop ends the session. F5 continues, F10 steps over, F11 steps into, and Shift+F5 stops."
L["The Debug button starts a separate session and pauses at the first executable line or breakpoint. Continue resumes execution, Step over advances past the current operation, and Step into enters instrumented script functions. Native functions cannot be stepped into. Stop ends the session. F5 continues, F10 steps over, F11 steps into, and Shift+F5 stops."] = "「偵錯」按鈕會啟動一個獨立的工作階段，並在第一個可執行列或中斷點處暫停。「繼續」會恢復執行，「不進入函式」會越過目前操作，「逐步執行」會進入已插樁的指令碼函式。無法逐步進入原生函式。「停止」會結束工作階段。F5 繼續，F10 不進入函式，F11 逐步執行，Shift+F5 停止。"
-- en: "The debugger terminal appears below the code while debugging. When paused, enter expressions or assignments to inspect or change the current variables. The drawer button hides or shows the terminal. Output provides a copyable report of printed output, terminal evaluations and complete errors."
L["The debugger terminal appears below the code while debugging. When paused, enter expressions or assignments to inspect or change the current variables. The drawer button hides or shows the terminal. Output provides a copyable report of printed output, terminal evaluations and complete errors."] = "偵錯時，偵錯器終端會顯示在程式碼下方。暫停時，可輸入運算式或指派陳述式來檢查或變更目前變數。抽屜按鈕可隱藏或顯示終端。「輸出」提供一份可複製的報告，包含列印輸出、終端求值結果與完整錯誤。"
-- en: "Argument"
L["Argument"] = "參數"
-- en: "Arguments and returns"
L["Arguments and returns"] = "參數與傳回值"
-- en: "Bindings (%d)"
L["Bindings (%d)"] = "綁定（%d）"
-- en: "Call a utility as namespace.name(...). Built In namespaces follow source files; custom functions choose their Namespace. Accepting a completion attaches its stable dependency binding; for a typed call, add its qualified name under Function bindings. Namespaces do not supply self. Pass a method receiver explicitly in a namespaced dot call; object:method(x) is Lua shorthand for object.method(object, x). Existing addon APIs remain compatible with saved definitions. Existing aliases still work. Renaming a function or namespace does not rewrite existing code or bindings. Missing, disabled or invalid dependencies keep consumers unavailable."
L["Call a utility as namespace.name(...). Built In namespaces follow source files; custom functions choose their Namespace. Accepting a completion attaches its stable dependency binding; for a typed call, add its qualified name under Function bindings. Namespaces do not supply self. Pass a method receiver explicitly in a namespaced dot call; object:method(x) is Lua shorthand for object.method(object, x). Existing addon APIs remain compatible with saved definitions. Existing aliases still work. Renaming a function or namespace does not rewrite existing code or bindings. Missing, disabled or invalid dependencies keep consumers unavailable."] = "以 namespace.name(...) 呼叫工具函式。內建命名空間與原始檔對應；自訂函式自行選擇其命名空間。接受自動完成會附加其穩定的相依綁定；對於具型別的呼叫，請在「函式綁定」下新增其完整限定名稱。命名空間不提供 self。在命名空間的點號呼叫中請明確傳入方法接收者；object:method(x) 是 Lua 中 object.method(object, x) 的簡寫。現有插件 API 與已儲存的定義保持相容。現有別名仍可使用。重新命名函式或命名空間不會改寫現有程式碼或綁定。缺少、已停用或無效的相依項目會讓使用它們的項目維持無法使用。"
-- en: "Changing argument or return order can break existing callers. Rotation Master will not rewrite their Lua code. Continue?"
L["Changing argument or return order can break existing callers. Rotation Master will not rewrite their Lua code. Continue?"] = "變更參數或傳回值的順序可能會破壞現有的呼叫端。Rotation Master 不會改寫它們的 Lua 程式碼。是否繼續？"
-- en: "Choose an existing namespace from the suggestions or type a new dotted namespace. Built In namespaces follow source files; custom namespaces are implied by saved functions and need no separate maintenance."
L["Choose an existing namespace from the suggestions or type a new dotted namespace. Built In namespaces follow source files; custom namespaces are implied by saved functions and need no separate maintenance."] = "從建議中選擇一個現有的命名空間，或輸入一個新的點分命名空間。內建命名空間與原始檔對應；自訂命名空間由已儲存的函式隱含產生，不需另外維護。"
-- en: "Click an Arguments or Returns heading to collapse or expand it. + Argument and + Return append when clicked, or insert at a highlighted gap when dragged. Drag a row or use Up / Down to reorder; Ctrl-drag carries following rows. The trash can removes a row. Type and Nullable document accepted values; Description explains each input or result. Lua can return several ordered results. Reordering a saved function warns because positional callers may need changes; RM does not rewrite call sites."
L["Click an Arguments or Returns heading to collapse or expand it. + Argument and + Return append when clicked, or insert at a highlighted gap when dragged. Drag a row or use Up / Down to reorder; Ctrl-drag carries following rows. The trash can removes a row. Type and Nullable document accepted values; Description explains each input or result. Lua can return several ordered results. Reordering a saved function warns because positional callers may need changes; RM does not rewrite call sites."] = "點擊「參數」或「傳回值」標題可將其摺疊或展開。「+ 參數」與「+ 傳回值」在點擊時附加到結尾，拖曳時則插入到醒目標示的空隙。拖曳某一列或使用「上移 / 下移」來重新排序；按住 Ctrl 拖曳會帶上後續的列。垃圾桶會移除一列。「型別」與「可為空」記錄可接受的值；「說明」解釋每個輸入或結果。Lua 可以依序傳回多個結果。對已儲存的函式重新排序時會發出警告，因為依位置呼叫的呼叫端可能需要修改；RM 不會改寫呼叫處。"
-- en: "Function names use letters, numbers and underscores, beginning with a letter or underscore. The code signature shows the qualified namespace.name used by callers."
L["Function names use letters, numbers and underscores, beginning with a letter or underscore. The code signature shows the qualified namespace.name used by callers."] = "函式名稱使用字母、數字與底線，並以字母或底線開頭。程式碼簽章會顯示呼叫端使用的完整限定名稱 namespace.name。"
-- en: "Return"
L["Return"] = "傳回值"
-- en: "Search helpers by name or description, then filter Built In / Custom and namespace. Packaged helpers use the same read-only pane. Duplicate creates an editable custom copy."
L["Search helpers by name or description, then filter Built In / Custom and namespace. Packaged helpers use the same read-only pane. Duplicate creates an editable custom copy."] = "依名稱或說明搜尋輔助函式，然後依「內建 / 自訂」與命名空間篩選。內建輔助函式使用相同的唯讀面板。「複製」會建立一個可編輯的自訂複本。"
-- en: "Changing argument order can break existing callers. Rotation Master will not rewrite their Lua code. Continue?"
L["Changing argument order can break existing callers. Rotation Master will not rewrite their Lua code. Continue?"] = "變更參數順序可能會破壞現有的呼叫端。Rotation Master 不會改寫它們的 Lua 程式碼。是否繼續？"
-- en: "Changing return documentation order does not rewrite return statements or existing callers. Review the Lua body and callers for the new order. Continue?"
L["Changing return documentation order does not rewrite return statements or existing callers. Review the Lua body and callers for the new order. Continue?"] = "變更傳回值說明的順序不會改寫 return 陳述式或現有的呼叫端。請依新的順序檢查 Lua 函式主體與呼叫端。是否繼續？"
-- en: "Click an Arguments or Returns heading to collapse or expand it. + Argument and + Return append when clicked, or insert at a highlighted gap when dragged. Drag a row or use Up / Down to reorder; Ctrl-drag carries following rows. The trash can removes a row. Type and Nullable document accepted values; Description explains each input or result. Lua can return several ordered results. Return rows describe those results; moving them does not rewrite return statements. Reordering a saved function warns because positional callers may need changes; RM does not rewrite call sites."
L["Click an Arguments or Returns heading to collapse or expand it. + Argument and + Return append when clicked, or insert at a highlighted gap when dragged. Drag a row or use Up / Down to reorder; Ctrl-drag carries following rows. The trash can removes a row. Type and Nullable document accepted values; Description explains each input or result. Lua can return several ordered results. Return rows describe those results; moving them does not rewrite return statements. Reordering a saved function warns because positional callers may need changes; RM does not rewrite call sites."] = "點擊「參數」或「傳回值」標題可將其摺疊或展開。「+ 參數」與「+ 傳回值」在點擊時附加到結尾，拖曳時則插入到醒目標示的空隙。拖曳某一列或使用「上移 / 下移」來重新排序；按住 Ctrl 拖曳會帶上後續的列。垃圾桶會移除一列。「型別」與「可為空」記錄可接受的值；「說明」解釋每個輸入或結果。Lua 可以依序傳回多個結果。傳回值列描述這些結果；移動它們不會改寫 return 陳述式。對已儲存的函式重新排序時會發出警告，因為依位置呼叫的呼叫端可能需要修改；RM 不會改寫呼叫處。"
-- en: "Card controls"
L["Card controls"] = "卡片控制項"
-- en: "Describe this value for function documentation, completion and hover help. Changes remain in the draft until Apply."
L["Describe this value for function documentation, completion and hover help. Changes remain in the draft until Apply."] = "說明此值，用於函式說明文件、自動完成與滑鼠提示說明。變更會保留在草稿中，直到按下「套用」。"
-- en: "Drag a card to reorder arguments; Ctrl-drag includes following arguments. Up and down move one position. Duplicate copies the argument with a unique name; the trash can removes it. Reordering a saved function requires confirmation because existing callers are not rewritten."
L["Drag a card to reorder arguments; Ctrl-drag includes following arguments. Up and down move one position. Duplicate copies the argument with a unique name; the trash can removes it. Reordering a saved function requires confirmation because existing callers are not rewritten."] = "拖曳卡片可重新排列參數；按住 Ctrl 拖曳會包括後續參數。上下箭頭每次移動一個位置。「複製」會以唯一的名稱複製參數；垃圾桶會移除它。對已儲存的函式重新排序需要確認，因為現有的呼叫端不會被改寫。"
-- en: "Drag a card to reorder return documentation; Ctrl-drag includes following returns. Up and down move one position. Duplicate copies the documented return value; the trash can removes it. Return order in this list does not rewrite return statements or callers."
L["Drag a card to reorder return documentation; Ctrl-drag includes following returns. Up and down move one position. Duplicate copies the documented return value; the trash can removes it. Return order in this list does not rewrite return statements or callers."] = "拖曳卡片可重新排列傳回值說明；按住 Ctrl 拖曳會包括後續傳回值。上下箭頭每次移動一個位置。「複製」會複製所記錄的傳回值；垃圾桶會移除它。此清單中的傳回值順序不會改寫 return 陳述式或呼叫端。"
-- en: "Preview rendered. Use Output for printed messages."
L["Preview rendered. Use Output for printed messages."] = "預覽已繪製。列印的訊息請在「輸出」中檢視。"
-- en: "Rendered output appears here when the callback runs or steps through widget creation."
L["Rendered output appears here when the callback runs or steps through widget creation."] = "當回呼執行或逐步執行元件建立時，繪製的輸出會顯示在這裡。"
-- en: "Set values in Test before running or debugging this condition."
L["Set values in Test before running or debugging this condition."] = "執行或偵錯此條件前，請先在「測試」中設定數值。"
-- en: "The argument name is the local parameter available in the Lua body. Use a valid Lua identifier. Renaming this documentation does not rewrite references in the code."
L["The argument name is the local parameter available in the Lua body. Use a valid Lua identifier. Renaming this documentation does not rewrite references in the code."] = "參數名稱是 Lua 函式主體中可用的區域參數。請使用有效的 Lua 識別碼。重新命名此說明不會改寫程式碼中的參照。"
-- en: "Type and Nullable describe the values accepted or returned by this function. They document the contract; they do not rewrite or validate values in the Lua body."
L["Type and Nullable describe the values accepted or returned by this function. They document the contract; they do not rewrite or validate values in the Lua body."] = "「型別」與「可為空」描述此函式接受或傳回的值。它們記錄的是約定；不會改寫或驗證 Lua 函式主體中的值。"
-- en: "Enable Rotation Master recommendations, automatic rotation switching and bound item-set updates. Disabling clears active advice and highlights and hides the preview. Apply saves the change."
L["Help.General.enable"] = "啟用 Rotation Master 的建議、自動切換循環與已綁定物品組的更新。停用會清除目前的建議與醒目提示，並隱藏預覽。「套用」會儲存變更。"
-- en: "Set how often Rotation Master reevaluates the active rotation and independent cooldowns, in seconds. A shorter interval updates advice more often and uses more processing time. It does not cast spells, queue actions, or predict future combat."
L["Help.General.poll"] = "設定 Rotation Master 重新評估目前循環與獨立冷卻的頻率，單位為秒。間隔越短，建議更新越頻繁，佔用的處理時間也越多。它不會施放法術、排入動作或預測未來的戰鬥。"
-- en: "Out of combat with no target and no focus, Rotation Master skips a polling tick unless something it watches has changed: auras, cooldowns, health or power of you, your pet or party, movement, casting, equipment, bags, form, pets or group. It still re-checks at least this often, for time-based conditions (aura or cooldown remaining), distance, and custom code. In combat, with any target or focus, or while configuration is open, every polling tick is evaluated. Zero evaluates every polling tick."
L["Help.General.idle_poll"] = "在非戰鬥狀態下且沒有目標與專注目標時，除非它所監視的內容發生變化，否則 Rotation Master 會略過一次輪詢：你、你的寵物或隊伍的光環、冷卻、生命力或能量，移動、施法、裝備、背包、形態、寵物或隊伍。對於基於時間的條件（光環或冷卻剩餘時間）、距離與自訂程式碼，它仍會至少依此頻率重新檢查。在戰鬥中、有任何目標或專注目標時，或設定介面開啟時，每次輪詢都會進行評估。為零時每次輪詢都會評估。"
-- en: "With automatic switching, Rotation Master checks this often, in and out of combat, whether a different rotation's switch conditions now match, so conditions that change on their own (nearby enemy count, threat, movement, health) take effect. Target, focus and pet changes are checked straight away. Zero turns automatic switching off. Choosing a rotation manually still overrides automatic switching until you choose Auto again."
L["Help.General.autoswitch_poll"] = "啟用自動切換時，Rotation Master 會依此頻率（無論是否在戰鬥中）檢查另一個循環的切換條件現在是否符合，從而讓那些會自行變化的條件（附近敵人數量、威脅值、移動、生命力）生效。目標、專注目標與寵物的變化會被立即檢查。為零時會關閉自動切換。手動選擇循環仍會覆蓋自動切換，直到你再次選擇「自動」。"
-- en: "Keep Rotation Master from automatically selecting another rotation from its switch condition. This preference survives reloads. Manually choosing a rotation with /rm set <rotation> also suspends automatic switching until you choose automatic selection again."
L["Help.General.disable_autoswitch"] = "阻止 Rotation Master 根據切換條件自動選擇其他循環。此偏好在重新載入後保留。使用 /rm set <rotation> 手動選擇循環也會暫停自動切換，直到你再次選擇自動選擇。"
-- en: "Hide the main rotation recommendation on action bars. Independent cooldown highlights remain available. Enable Preview Spells if you want to see the main advice in a separate window; with both displays off, the main recommendation has no visible icon."
L["Help.General.disable_buttons"] = "隱藏快捷列上的主循環建議。獨立的冷卻醒目提示仍然可用。若想在獨立的視窗中檢視主要建議，請啟用「預覽法術」；如果兩種顯示都關閉，主要建議將沒有可見的圖示。"
-- en: "Set the refresh interval for condition status while editing, in seconds. Zero turns off periodic status updates. This is separate from the recommendation polling interval and does not enable live condition testing unless you explicitly choose it."
L["Help.General.live_config_update"] = "設定編輯時條件狀態的更新間隔，單位為秒。為零時關閉定期狀態更新。這與建議的輪詢間隔分開，除非你明確選擇，否則不會啟用即時條件測試。"
-- en: "Show the Rotation Master minimap icon. Left-click toggles the configuration window. Right-click opens the quick menu for enabling recommendations and choosing a rotation or automatic switching."
L["Help.General.minimap"] = "顯示 Rotation Master 小地圖按鈕。左鍵點擊可開關設定視窗。右鍵點擊可開啟快速選單，用於啟用建議以及選擇循環或自動切換。"
-- en: "Choose Diagram or List as the starting rotation view. This profile preference applies when opening a rotation; changing the view inside the editor does not change this setting. Cooldowns always use a scrolling grid."
L["Help.General.rotation_view"] = "選擇「圖表」或「清單」作為初始的循環檢視。此設定檔偏好會在開啟循環時生效；在編輯器內變更檢視不會改變此設定。冷卻總是使用可捲動的網格。"
-- en: "Choose how many seconds of previous spell casts to retain for history-based conditions. Older casts are removed as recommendations update. A longer history retains more records."
L["Help.General.spell_history"] = "選擇為基於歷史的條件保留多少秒的過往施法記錄。較早的施法會在建議更新時被移除。歷史越長，保留的記錄越多。"
-- en: "Choose how many seconds of combat events to retain for conditions such as recent hits, parries and blocks. Older events are removed as recommendations update. Availability depends on the client combat-data policy."
L["Help.General.combat_history"] = "選擇為「最近被命中、招架與格擋」等條件保留多少秒的戰鬥事件。較早的事件會在建議更新時被移除。可用性取決於用戶端的戰鬥資料政策。"
-- en: "Choose how many seconds of observed damage and healing to retain for burn-rate and time-to-die estimates. Recent observations receive more weight. A longer window uses more records and smooths short changes; it cannot supply events the client does not expose."
L["Help.General.damage_history"] = "選擇保留多少秒觀測到的傷害與治療，用於計算消耗速率與死亡時間估算。較新的觀測權重較高。時間區間越長，使用的記錄越多，短期波動越平滑；但它無法提供用戶端未公開的事件。"
-- en: "Choose a whole number of upcoming recommendations, from zero (hidden) to five. The preview shows current priority results, not a simulation of future cooldowns or combat. Icons start at 64 pixels; resizing scales all icons while preserving their square shape and the window ratio."
L["Help.General.preview_spells"] = "選擇要顯示的後續建議數量（整數），從零（隱藏）到五。預覽顯示的是目前優先順序的結果，而不是對未來冷卻或戰鬥的模擬。圖示初始為 64 像素；調整大小會縮放所有圖示，同時保持其正方形外觀與視窗比例。"
-- en: "Adjust the preview background and title bar opacity without fading its icons. At zero only the icons remain, and the hidden frame does not intercept blank-space clicks. Restore opacity in General to access the title bar and resize handle."
L["Help.General.preview_opacity"] = "調整預覽背景與標題列的不透明度，而不會淡化其圖示。為零時只保留圖示，隱藏的框架不會攔截空白處的點擊。要使用標題列與調整大小的控點，請在「一般」中還原不透明度。"
-- en: "Prevent moving the preview by its title bar or resizing it by its lower-right corner. Locking and unlocking take effect immediately and are saved without Apply. Other pending General edits remain unchanged."
L["Help.General.preview_locked"] = "防止透過標題列移動預覽，或透過右下角調整其大小。鎖定與解鎖會立即生效，並且不需「套用」即可儲存。其他待處理的一般編輯保持不變。"
-- en: "Arrange preview icons horizontally (default) or vertically. Lock, Direction and Reset share one row below the opacity slider. Changing direction keeps icons square and adjusts the window ratio."
L["Help.General.preview_vertical"] = "將預覽圖示水平（預設）或垂直排列。「鎖定」「方向」與「重設」位於不透明度滑桿下方的同一列。變更方向會保持圖示為正方形並調整視窗比例。"
-- en: "Immediately return the preview window to the screen center and restore 64-pixel icons without Apply. Other pending settings are preserved."
L["Help.General.preview_reset"] = "立即將預覽視窗移回螢幕中央，並還原 64 像素的圖示，不需按「套用」。其他待處理的設定會被保留。"
-- en: "This icon previews the selected profile effect, color, size, anchor and offsets. Previewing an effect does not save the draft or change the spell being recommended."
L["Help.General.preview"] = "此圖示會預覽所選設定檔的效果、顏色、大小、錨點與偏移。預覽效果不會儲存草稿，也不會改變正在建議的法術。"
-- en: "Choose the highlight used for the main recommendation and as the default for independent cooldowns. Manage available effects on the Effects page. A cooldown can override these profile settings in its action details."
L["Help.General.effect"] = "選擇用於主要建議的醒目提示效果，它同時也是獨立冷卻的預設效果。在「效果」頁面管理可用的效果。冷卻可以在其動作詳情中覆蓋這些設定檔設定。"
-- en: "Scale the highlight relative to its action icon. A value of 1 uses the icon size. Drag the slider or type its numeric value; the preview updates as you edit."
L["Help.General.magnification"] = "相對於動作圖示縮放醒目提示。值為 1 時使用圖示大小。拖曳滑桿或輸入數值；預覽會隨編輯即時更新。"
-- en: "Choose the highlight color and opacity. Click the color swatch to open the picker, or enter R, G, B and A values between 0 and 1. Alpha controls opacity; individual cooldowns may override this profile color."
L["Help.General.color"] = "選擇醒目提示的顏色與不透明度。點擊色塊可開啟取色器，或輸入 0 到 1 之間的 R、G、B 與 A 值。Alpha 控制不透明度；單一冷卻可以覆蓋此設定檔顏色。"
-- en: "Choose the point on the action icon where a texture highlight is anchored by its center. Changing Anchor resets the offsets. The preview shows the resulting placement; non-texture glows may use offsets without a texture anchor."
L["Help.General.setpoint"] = "選擇材質醒目提示以其中心錨定在動作圖示上的哪個點。變更錨點會重設偏移。預覽會顯示最終的位置；非材質類發光效果可能在沒有材質錨點的情況下使用偏移。"
-- en: "Vertical offset in pixels. Use Up or Down on the position control, or edit V directly. Hold Shift while using an arrow for ten pixels. Center resets both offsets and the anchor to Center."
L["Help.General.yoffs"] = "以像素為單位的垂直偏移。使用位置控制項上的「上」或「下」，或直接編輯「縱」。使用箭頭時按住 Shift 每次移動十像素。「置中」會將兩個偏移與錨點重設為置中。"
-- en: "Horizontal offset in pixels. Use Left or Right on the position control, or edit H directly. Hold Shift while using an arrow for ten pixels. Non-texture glows interpret offsets according to their effect shape."
L["Help.General.xoffs"] = "以像素為單位的水平偏移。使用位置控制項上的「左」或「右」，或直接編輯「橫」。使用箭頭時按住 Shift 每次移動十像素。非材質類發光效果會根據其效果形狀來解釋偏移。"
-- en: "Choose the display name for your primary specialization. This changes its label in Rotation Master, not your character talents or specialization."
L["Help.General.spec1"] = "選擇主要專精的顯示名稱。這只會改變它在 Rotation Master 中的標籤，不會改變角色的天賦或專精。"
-- en: "Choose the display name for your secondary specialization. This changes its label in Rotation Master, not your character talents or specialization."
L["Help.General.spec2"] = "選擇次要專精的顯示名稱。這只會改變它在 Rotation Master 中的標籤，不會改變角色的天賦或專精。"
-- en: "Choose the amount of Rotation Master chat output. Silent suppresses routine output. Default reports normal changes such as rotation switching. Debug adds runtime statistics and trigger information. Verbose includes detailed condition and highlight activity and can produce substantial output."
L["Help.General.loglevel"] = "選擇 Rotation Master 在聊天框中的輸出量。「靜默」會抑制一般輸出。「預設」會回報循環切換等正常變化。「偵錯」會增加執行階段統計與觸發資訊。「詳細」包含詳細的條件與醒目提示活動，可能產生大量輸出。"
-- en: "Include component timings in the periodic Debug or Verbose profiling report. Reports show measured runs, total, minimum, average and maximum in milliseconds. Timings include child work; nested scopes overlap and must not be added together. The overall scope starts after rotation preparation. This is elapsed timing, not the native addon CPU report."
L["Help.General.detailed_profiling"] = "在定期的偵錯或詳細效能分析報告中包含各元件的耗時。報告以毫秒為單位顯示測量次數、總計、最小值、平均值與最大值。耗時包含子任務；巢狀的範圍會相互重疊，不能相加。整體範圍從循環準備完成後開始計時。這是經過時間，而不是原生的插件 CPU 報告。"
-- en: "Effects define how action-bar icons are highlighted. They are shared across characters. General settings select the main recommendation effect and cooldown default; individual cooldowns can choose another effect. Select an effect in the sidebar to inspect or edit it."
L["Help.Effects.overview"] = "效果定義了快捷列圖示的醒目提示方式。效果在所有角色間共用。一般設定會選擇主要建議效果與冷卻的預設效果；單一冷卻可以選擇其他效果。在側邊欄中選擇一個效果以檢視或編輯。"
-- en: "Give the effect a name used by selectors in General and cooldown action details. New drafts can change type and fields before being named, but Apply requires a nonempty, unique name."
L["Help.Effects.name"] = "為效果命名，該名稱用於「一般」與冷卻動作詳情中的選擇器。新草稿可以在命名前變更類型與欄位，但「套用」要求名稱非空且唯一。"
-- en: "Choose the highlight implementation. Changing type stages the new fields and resets its sequence because different sequence types store different values. Choosing the current type preserves existing values. Apply saves the change; Discard restores the saved effect."
L["Help.Effects.type"] = "選擇醒目提示的實作方式。變更類型會暫存新的欄位並重設其序列，因為不同的序列類型儲存不同的值。選擇目前類型會保留現有值。「套用」會儲存變更；「捨棄」會還原已儲存的效果。"
-- en: "Texture: overlay a single image from game data or an installed addon. Its color, magnification and position come from the profile or the individual cooldown."
L["Help.Effects.type.texture"] = "材質：疊加一張來自遊戲資料或已安裝插件的圖像。其顏色、放大倍率與位置來自設定檔或單一冷卻。"
-- en: "Pixel: animate short lines around the action icon border. Lines, Frequency, Length and Thickness control this library glow."
L["Help.Effects.type.pixel"] = "像素：在動作圖示邊框周圍顯示移動的短線條。「線條數」「頻率」「長度」與「粗細」控制此函式庫發光效果。"
-- en: "Auto Cast: animate groups of glowing particles around the action icon. Particles, Frequency and Scale control this library glow."
L["Help.Effects.type.autocast"] = "自動施法：在動作圖示周圍顯示成組移動的發光粒子。「粒子數」「頻率」與「縮放」控制此函式庫發光效果。"
-- en: "Glow: use the familiar Blizzard-style button glow. Frequency controls its animation rate."
L["Help.Effects.type.blizzard"] = "發光：使用熟悉的暴雪風格按鈕發光效果。「頻率」控制其動畫速率。"
-- en: "Dazzle: keep one texture and cycle through the sequence of colors. Each sequence card contains one RGBA color."
L["Help.Effects.type.dazzle"] = "炫光：保持同一材質，並依序循環序列中的顏色。每張序列卡片包含一種 RGBA 顏色。"
-- en: "Animate: cycle through the sequence of texture images. Each card selects one image and previews that selection."
L["Help.Effects.type.animate"] = "動畫：依序循環序列中的材質圖像。每張卡片選擇一張圖像並預覽該選擇。"
-- en: "Pulse: keep one texture and cycle through the sequence of magnifications. Each card selects one scale relative to the action icon."
L["Help.Effects.type.pulse"] = "脈衝：保持同一材質，並依序循環序列中的放大倍率。每張卡片選擇一個相對於動作圖示的縮放比例。"
-- en: "Rotate: animate one texture through evenly spaced angles around a full circle. Steps chooses the number of angles and Reverse changes their order."
L["Help.Effects.type.rotate"] = "旋轉：讓一張材質以均勻分布的角度旋轉一整圈。「步數」選擇角度數量，「反向」會改變其順序。"
-- en: "Custom: cycle through cards containing a texture, angle, magnification and color. Each card supplies its own settings instead of relying on one shared texture."
L["Help.Effects.type.custom"] = "自訂：依序循環包含材質、角度、放大倍率與顏色的卡片。每張卡片提供各自的設定，而不是共用一張材質。"
-- en: "The image beside Name and Type previews the current draft with a white color and standard size. Texture and sequence changes update the preview without saving. Actual recommendations use their profile or cooldown color, size and offsets."
L["Help.Effects.preview"] = "「名稱」與「類型」旁邊的圖像會以白色與標準大小預覽目前草稿。材質與序列的變更會更新預覽而不儲存。實際建議時使用其設定檔或冷卻的顏色、大小與偏移。"
-- en: "For Texture, Dazzle, Pulse and Rotate, choose the image used throughout the effect. The arrow beside an image field opens the bundled overlay catalog with previews. Enter an available texture path or numeric file ID to use another image. Animate and Custom choose images in their sequence cards using the same controls. Selections update the draft and preview; Apply saves them."
L["Help.Effects.texture"] = "對於「材質」「炫光」「脈衝」與「旋轉」，選擇整個效果中使用的圖像。圖像欄位旁邊的箭頭會開啟附帶預覽的內建疊加圖庫。輸入一個可用的材質路徑或數字檔案 ID 即可使用其他圖像。「動畫」與「自訂」在其序列卡片中使用相同的控制項選擇圖像。選擇會更新草稿與預覽；「套用」會儲存它們。"
-- en: "Pixel effects: choose the number of animated lines around the button, from 1 to 20."
L["Help.Effects.pixel.lines"] = "像素效果：選擇按鈕周圍移動線條的數量，範圍為 1 到 20。"
-- en: "Pixel effects: signed cycles per second. A larger magnitude moves faster; a negative value reverses direction. Zero uses the glow library default of one cycle every four seconds."
L["Help.Effects.pixel.frequency"] = "像素效果：每秒的循環次數（帶正負號）。絕對值越大移動越快；負值會反轉方向。為零時使用發光函式庫的預設值，即每四秒一個循環。"
-- en: "Pixel effects: choose line length in pixels. The glow library limits it to the smaller button dimension."
L["Help.Effects.pixel.length"] = "像素效果：選擇線條長度（像素）。發光函式庫會將其限制為按鈕較短的一邊。"
-- en: "Pixel effects: choose line thickness in pixels, from 1 to 5."
L["Help.Effects.pixel.thickness"] = "像素效果：選擇線條粗細（像素），範圍為 1 到 5。"
-- en: "Auto Cast effects: choose 1 to 4 particles in each of the glow library particle groups."
L["Help.Effects.autocast.particles"] = "自動施法效果：選擇發光函式庫每個粒子組中的粒子數，範圍為 1 到 4。"
-- en: "Auto Cast effects: signed cycles per second. A larger magnitude moves faster; a negative value reverses direction. Zero uses the glow library default of one cycle every eight seconds."
L["Help.Effects.autocast.frequency"] = "自動施法效果：每秒的循環次數（帶正負號）。絕對值越大移動越快；負值會反轉方向。為零時使用發光函式庫的預設值，即每八秒一個循環。"
-- en: "Auto Cast effects: scale the particles relative to the glow library default. A value of 1 uses their normal size."
L["Help.Effects.autocast.scale"] = "自動施法效果：相對於發光函式庫的預設值縮放粒子。值為 1 時使用其正常大小。"
-- en: "Glow effects: adjust the library animation rate. Larger positive values animate faster. Zero uses the library default rather than stopping the glow."
L["Help.Effects.blizzard.frequency"] = "發光效果：調整函式庫的動畫速率。正值越大動畫越快。為零時使用函式庫的預設值，而不是停止發光。"
-- en: "Dazzle effects: seconds between color cards. A smaller positive interval changes colors more often; the sequence repeats after the last color."
L["Help.Effects.dazzle.frequency"] = "炫光效果：顏色卡片之間的間隔秒數。正值越小，顏色變化越頻繁；序列在最後一種顏色後重複。"
-- en: "Animate effects: seconds between texture cards. A smaller positive interval changes images more often; the sequence repeats after the last image."
L["Help.Effects.animate.frequency"] = "動畫效果：材質卡片之間的間隔秒數。正值越小，圖像變化越頻繁；序列在最後一張圖像後重複。"
-- en: "Pulse effects: seconds between magnification cards. A smaller positive interval changes size more often; the sequence repeats after the last size."
L["Help.Effects.pulse.frequency"] = "脈衝效果：放大倍率卡片之間的間隔秒數。正值越小，大小變化越頻繁；序列在最後一個大小後重複。"
-- en: "Rotate effects: seconds between angle steps. A smaller positive interval rotates faster. One full cycle uses this interval multiplied by Steps."
L["Help.Effects.rotate.frequency"] = "旋轉效果：每個角度步進之間的間隔秒數。正值越小旋轉越快。一個完整循環的時長為此間隔乘以步數。"
-- en: "Rotate effects: choose 2 to 36 evenly spaced angles for a full turn. More steps at the same Frequency interval make a longer complete cycle."
L["Help.Effects.rotate.steps"] = "旋轉效果：為一整圈選擇 2 到 36 個均勻分布的角度。在相同的頻率間隔下，步數越多，完整循環越長。"
-- en: "Rotate effects: reverse the order of angle steps. Changing this checkbox does not alter the texture or number of steps."
L["Help.Effects.rotate.reverse"] = "旋轉效果：反轉角度步進的順序。變更此核取方塊不會改變材質或步數。"
-- en: "Custom effects: seconds between sequence cards. A smaller positive interval changes settings more often; the sequence repeats after the last card."
L["Help.Effects.custom.frequency"] = "自訂效果：序列卡片之間的間隔秒數。正值越小，設定變化越頻繁；序列在最後一張卡片後重複。"
-- en: "Sequence cards play in order and repeat. Add step, on the Sequence header row, appends a card; drag Add step into a gap to insert one there. Drag a card into an insertion gap to reorder it; hold Ctrl when starting to carry it and all following cards. Up and Down move one card and are disabled at their respective ends. The red trash removes a card from the draft. Canceling a drag restores its original position."
L["Help.Effects.sequence"] = "序列卡片依序播放並重複。「序列」標題列上的「新增步驟」會附加一張卡片；將「新增步驟」拖入空隙可在該處插入。將卡片拖入插入空隙可重新排序；開始拖曳時按住 Ctrl 可帶上它及其後所有卡片。「上移」與「下移」每次移動一張卡片，到達兩端時無法使用。紅色垃圾桶會從草稿中移除卡片。取消拖曳會還原其原始位置。"
-- en: "Animate and Custom cards: choose a texture path or numeric file ID. The card preview shows the selected image. Custom also keeps an independent angle, magnification and color on that card."
L["Help.Effects.sequence.texture"] = "「動畫」與「自訂」卡片：選擇材質路徑或數字檔案 ID。卡片預覽會顯示所選圖像。「自訂」還會在該卡片上保留獨立的角度、放大倍率與顏色。"
-- en: "Custom cards: set the texture angle in degrees from 0 to 359. This is the angle for this card, rather than a continuous rotation speed."
L["Help.Effects.sequence.angle"] = "「自訂」卡片：設定材質角度，單位為度，範圍為 0 到 359。這是此卡片的角度，而不是持續旋轉的速度。"
-- en: "Pulse and Custom cards: scale the texture relative to the action icon. A value of 1 uses the icon size. Use the slider or edit its numeric value."
L["Help.Effects.sequence.magnification"] = "「脈衝」與「自訂」卡片：相對於動作圖示縮放材質。值為 1 時使用圖示大小。使用滑桿或編輯其數值。"
-- en: "Dazzle and Custom cards: choose an RGBA color. Click the swatch to open the picker, or edit channels between 0 and 1. Alpha controls opacity."
L["Help.Effects.sequence.color"] = "「炫光」與「自訂」卡片：選擇一種 RGBA 顏色。點擊色塊可開啟取色器，或編輯 0 到 1 之間的通道值。Alpha 控制不透明度。"
-- en: "Edits and sequence changes remain in a draft. Apply saves; Discard restores the saved effect. Cancel closes a new creation draft. View Changes compares saved and unsaved values. New drafts require a unique name and valid fields before Apply. Leaving with edits offers Apply, Discard or Cancel."
L["Help.Effects.save"] = "編輯與序列變更會保留在草稿中。「套用」會儲存；「捨棄」會還原已儲存的效果。「取消」會關閉新建的草稿。「檢視變更」會比較已儲存與未儲存的值。新草稿在套用前需要唯一的名稱與有效的欄位。有編輯時離開會提供「套用」「捨棄」或「取消」。"
-- en: "The red trash at the upper right deletes the selected effect after a permanent-deletion warning. Resolve pending edits first. Choose a replacement for any profile or cooldown using that effect; deletion does not silently rewrite those references."
L["Help.Effects.delete"] = "右上角的紅色垃圾桶會在永久刪除警告後刪除所選效果。請先處理待處理的編輯。為任何使用該效果的設定檔或冷卻選擇替代效果；刪除不會悄悄改寫這些參照。"
-- en: "New, Duplicate, Import/Export and Compare are below the sidebar. Duplicate copies the selected effect into a draft. Transfers show the original name and let you create a renamed copy or replace the selection when allowed. Compare inspects differences without saving them."
L["Help.Effects.collections"] = "「新增」「複製」「匯入/匯出」與「比較」位於側邊欄下方。「複製」會將所選效果複製到一個草稿中。傳輸時會顯示原始名稱，並允許你建立一個重新命名的複本，或在允許時取代所選項目。「比較」會檢查差異但不儲存。"
-- en: "Debuffs"
L["Debuffs"] = "減益效果"
-- en: "Resources"
L["Resources"] = "資源"
-- en: "Pet"
L["Pet"] = "寵物"
-- en: "Logic"
L["Logic"] = "邏輯"
-- en: "Environment"
L["Environment"] = "環境"
-- en: "Time"
L["Time"] = "時間"
-- en: "Spell Auto-Repeat Active"
L["Spell Auto-Repeat Active"] = "法術自動重複中"
-- en: "%s {{!is|is not}} auto-repeating"
L["%s {{!is|is not}} auto-repeating"] = "%s{{!正在|沒有在}}自動重複"
-- en: "Tests whether the selected spell is currently auto-repeating, such as Shoot or Auto Shot. This is different from a spell being current or queued: a queued cast alone does not satisfy this condition. Unavailable client observations remain unavailable even when negated."
L["Tests whether the selected spell is currently auto-repeating, such as Shoot or Auto Shot. This is different from a spell being current or queued: a queued cast alone does not satisfy this condition. Unavailable client observations remain unavailable even when negated."] = "檢測所選法術目前是否在自動重複，例如射擊或自動射擊。這與法術處於目前或佇列狀態不同：僅有佇列中的施法並不符合此條件。無法使用的用戶端觀測即使被反轉也仍為無法使用。"
-- en: "Uses readable positions in the same instance, or player-centered range estimates when positions are unavailable. A unit counts only when its upper range bound is within Distance. Uncertain positions, range, subgroup membership or required health/mana values keep the whole condition unavailable, including under Unless. Percentage checks require a positive maximum; empty aggregates have no result."
L["Uses readable positions in the same instance, or player-centered range estimates when positions are unavailable. A unit counts only when its upper range bound is within Distance. Uncertain positions, range, subgroup membership or required health/mana values keep the whole condition unavailable, including under Unless. Percentage checks require a positive maximum; empty aggregates have no result."] = "使用同一副本中可讀的位置；位置無法使用時，使用以玩家為中心的距離估算。只有當某個單位的距離上限在「距離」之內時才計入。位置、距離、小隊成員身分或所需的生命力/法力不確定時，整個條件將為無法使用，在「除非」下同樣如此。百分比檢查要求最大值為正；空的彙總沒有結果。"
-- en: "Count enemies when selected, or non-enemies when cleared."
L["Count enemies when selected, or non-enemies when cleared."] = "勾選時統計敵人，取消勾選時統計非敵人。"
-- en: "The number of observed units proven within Distance of you."
L["The number of observed units proven within Distance of you."] = "已確認位於你「距離」範圍內的已觀測單位數量。"
-- en: "Counts the addon's observed unit snapshot, including nameplates and tracked unit aliases, rather than every nearby unit. A unit counts only when its upper range bound is within Distance; uncertain membership or unreadable identity, hostility, range or nameplate settings makes the whole count unavailable, including under Unless. Known vanished or reused unit tokens are excluded. Distance cannot exceed the current nameplate distance setting; that setting does not guarantee a complete scan."
L["Counts the addon's observed unit snapshot, including nameplates and tracked unit aliases, rather than every nearby unit. A unit counts only when its upper range bound is within Distance; uncertain membership or unreadable identity, hostility, range or nameplate settings makes the whole count unavailable, including under Unless. Known vanished or reused unit tokens are excluded. Distance cannot exceed the current nameplate distance setting; that setting does not guarantee a complete scan."] = "統計的是插件已觀測到的單位快照，包括名條與被追蹤的單位別名，而不是附近的每個單位。只有當某個單位的距離上限在「距離」之內時才計入；成員身分不確定，或身分、敵對狀態、距離或名條設定無法讀取，都會使整個計數為無法使用，在「除非」下同樣如此。已知消失或被重複使用的單位代碼會被排除。「距離」不能超過目前的名條距離設定；該設定也不能保證掃描完整。"
-- en: "Selecting a sidebar row only inspects that profile. Activate profile switches the live profile immediately, including its rotations and settings. The active profile shows Active profile instead. This operation does not wait for page Apply."
L["Help.Profiles.activate"] = "選擇側邊欄中的一列只會檢視該設定檔。「啟用設定檔」會立即切換實際使用的設定檔，包括其循環與設定。目前使用中的設定檔會顯示為「使用中的設定檔」。此操作不需要等待頁面上的「套用」。"
-- en: "Choose a source to replace the active profile after confirmation. This copies settings and rotations into the active profile, even when the sidebar is inspecting a different profile. It does not switch to the source or rename the active profile. Cancel at the confirmation preserves the current profile."
L["Help.Profiles.copy"] = "選擇一個來源，在確認後取代目前使用中的設定檔。這會將設定與循環複製到目前使用中的設定檔，即使側邊欄正在檢視另一個設定檔。它不會切換到來源設定檔，也不會重新命名目前設定檔。在確認時按「取消」會保留目前設定檔。"
-- en: "Reset current profile replaces the active profile with its defaults after confirmation. Custom rotations and settings in it are replaced. The control is disabled while inspecting another profile. Reset is immediate after confirmation; there is no later page Apply to undo it."
L["Help.Profiles.reset"] = "「重設目前設定檔」會在確認後用預設值取代目前使用中的設定檔。其中的自訂循環與設定會被取代。檢視其他設定檔時此控制項無法使用。重設在確認後立即生效；之後沒有頁面上的「套用」可以復原它。"
-- en: "The red trash can permanently removes the selected inactive profile after confirmation. The active profile and Default cannot be deleted here. Selecting another profile does not delete or activate it."
L["Help.Profiles.delete"] = "紅色垃圾桶會在確認後永久移除所選的未使用設定檔。目前使用中的設定檔與 Default 不能在此刪除。選擇另一個設定檔不會刪除或啟用它。"
-- en: "New and Duplicate open a named draft. Use a nonblank, unused name of at most 50 characters. Apply creates the profile; Cancel abandons creation. Creating a profile leaves the previously active profile active, so use Activate profile when you want to switch to the new copy."
L["Help.Profiles.new_name"] = "「新增」與「複製」會開啟一個命名草稿。請使用不超過 50 個字元、非空且未被使用的名稱。「套用」會建立設定檔；「取消」會放棄建立。建立設定檔後，之前使用中的設定檔仍維持使用中，因此想切換到新複本時請使用「啟用設定檔」。"
-- en: "The buttons below the list create a new profile, duplicate the selected profile, transfer profiles or compare saved settings. Search narrows the list without activating a profile. Import/Export shows the original name and lets you replace the selection or create a renamed copy. Importing a new profile opens a creation draft; Apply saves it. Replacing a selected profile happens when you confirm the import, and replacing the active profile updates its runtime settings. Compare does not apply changes."
L["Help.Profiles.collections"] = "清單下方的按鈕可新增設定檔、複製所選設定檔、傳輸設定檔或比較已儲存的設定。搜尋會縮小清單範圍，但不會啟用設定檔。「匯入/匯出」會顯示原始名稱，並允許你取代所選項目或建立一個重新命名的複本。匯入新設定檔會開啟一個新建草稿；「套用」會儲存它。取代所選設定檔會在你確認匯入時發生，取代目前使用中的設定檔會更新其執行階段設定。「比較」不會套用變更。"
-- en: "Status pills show Not loaded, Supported, Disabled, Enabled or Selected. Click Enabled to Select or Disable. Disabling Selected chooses the sole enabled available editor, offers a choice when several exist, or leaves none selected. Enabling an editor when none is selected selects it automatically. Native is always available; its Syntax highlighting option is independent of editor selection. With no enabled editor, emergency plain text remains usable. Apply saves preferences for the next source-editor opening; Discard keeps saved settings. An open editor keeps its current provider."
L["Help.Integrations.lua_editor"] = "狀態標籤會顯示「未載入」「受支援」「已停用」「已啟用」或「已選擇」。點擊「已啟用」可選擇或停用。停用「已選擇」的編輯器時，若只有一個已啟用的可用編輯器則自動選擇它，若有多個則讓你選擇，否則不選擇任何編輯器。在沒有已選編輯器時啟用一個編輯器會自動選擇它。「原生」始終可用；其「語法突顯」選項與編輯器選擇無關。沒有已啟用的編輯器時，緊急純文字仍可使用。「套用」會儲存偏好，供下次開啟原始碼編輯器時使用；「捨棄」會保留已儲存的設定。已開啟的編輯器會保持其目前的提供者。"
-- en: "Show line numbers controls the gutter in every condition and function code editor. It defaults to enabled. Apply saves the preference and updates open code panes; Discard keeps the saved setting. It does not change the Lua source or its line breaks."
L["Help.Integrations.lua_line_numbers"] = "「顯示行號」控制每個條件與函式程式碼編輯器中的行號欄。預設啟用。「套用」會儲存偏好並更新已開啟的程式碼面板；「捨棄」會保留已儲存的設定。它不會變更 Lua 原始碼或其換行。"
-- en: "Addon names open copyable official release and source links across available providers. Edition filtering follows declared support for the matching addon identity; unknown compatibility remains visible. An older release date alone does not prove incompatibility. Listed game-edition support describes publisher release evidence, not certification of the integration on your client. Some integrations have only historical or unverified releases. Not loaded means unavailable to RM; Supported identifies an available integration without an enable switch. Bundled libraries are excluded. Rotation Master does not install or enable other addons."
L["Help.Integrations.optional_addons"] = "點擊插件名稱會開啟可複製的官方發布頁與原始碼連結，涵蓋所有可用的提供平台。版本篩選依據相應插件身分所宣告的支援；相容性未知的項目仍會顯示。僅憑較早的發布日期並不能證明不相容。所列出的遊戲版本支援描述的是發布者的發布證據，而不是對該整合在你用戶端上的認證。部分整合只有歷史版本或未經驗證的版本。「未載入」表示 RM 無法使用；「受支援」表示一個可用但沒有啟用開關的整合。內嵌的函式庫不在此列。Rotation Master 不會安裝或啟用其他插件。"
-- en: "Apply / Discard"
L["Apply / Discard"] = "套用 / 捨棄"
-- en: "Edits stay in a draft until Apply. Discard abandons pending changes. Leaving with changes offers Apply, Discard or Cancel; Cancel keeps the page and draft open. Effect previews do not save changes. Action-bar binding operations are explicit and immediate."
L["Edits stay in a draft until Apply. Discard abandons pending changes. Leaving with changes offers Apply, Discard or Cancel; Cancel keeps the page and draft open. Effect previews do not save changes. Action-bar binding operations are explicit and immediate."] = "編輯內容會保留為草稿，直到按下「套用」。「捨棄」會丟棄待處理的變更。有變更時離開會提供「套用」「捨棄」或「取消」；「取消」會保持頁面與草稿開啟。效果預覽不會儲存變更。快捷列綁定操作是明確的，且立即生效。"
-- en: "Diagram / List changes only the rotation view; General settings choose the default. Diagram has floating minus, percentage and plus controls at the bottom right. Scroll to zoom from 25% to 200%; click the percentage or middle-click to reset to 100%. Drag empty diagram space to pan. List uses normal scrollbars with touching cards and boxed branch arms, False before True. Cooldowns use a separate scrolling grid. Dragging cards reorders them in every view. Valid rotation bodies can contain up to 2,000 total steps; large workspaces reuse nearby card controls as you navigate. Folded branches intentionally hide their children."
L["Diagram / List changes only the rotation view; General settings choose the default. Diagram has floating minus, percentage and plus controls at the bottom right. Scroll to zoom from 25% to 200%; click the percentage or middle-click to reset to 100%. Drag empty diagram space to pan. List uses normal scrollbars with touching cards and boxed branch arms, False before True. Cooldowns use a separate scrolling grid. Dragging cards reorders them in every view. Valid rotation bodies can contain up to 2,000 total steps; large workspaces reuse nearby card controls as you navigate. Folded branches intentionally hide their children."] = "「圖表 / 清單」只改變循環檢視；預設檢視在一般設定中選擇。圖表檢視右下角有浮動的減號、百分比與加號控制項。捲動滾輪可在 25% 到 200% 之間縮放；點擊百分比或按滑鼠中鍵可重設為 100%。拖曳圖表空白處可平移。清單檢視使用一般捲軸，卡片緊密相連，分支以方框顯示，「假」在「真」之前。冷卻使用另外的可捲動網格。在任一檢視中拖曳卡片都可重新排序。有效的循環主體最多可包含 2,000 個步驟；大型工作區會在你瀏覽時重複使用附近的卡片控制項。摺疊的分支會刻意隱藏其子項目。"
-- en: "New / Duplicate / Import / Compare"
L["New / Duplicate / Import / Compare"] = "新增 / 複製 / 匯入 / 比較"
-- en: "Choose a category and search for a condition. Hidden removes it from pickers without deleting its definition. Switch Condition controls its availability for automatic rotation switching. Move To stages a category destination; its Apply button confirms the move. The assigned category opens category management. Sidebar arrows and dragging order entries. Page Apply saves the draft; Discard abandons edits to a saved entry. Custom conditions can be edited, duplicated or deleted."
L["Choose a category and search for a condition. Hidden removes it from pickers without deleting its definition. Switch Condition controls its availability for automatic rotation switching. Move To stages a category destination; its Apply button confirms the move. The assigned category opens category management. Sidebar arrows and dragging order entries. Page Apply saves the draft; Discard abandons edits to a saved entry. Custom conditions can be edited, duplicated or deleted."] = "選擇一個分類並搜尋條件。「隱藏」會將其從選擇器中移除，但不刪除其定義。「切換條件」控制它能否用於自動切換循環。「移動到」會暫存一個目標分類；其「套用」按鈕會確認移動。點擊已指派的分類會開啟分類管理。側邊欄箭頭與拖曳可調整項目順序。頁面上的「套用」會儲存草稿；「捨棄」會丟棄對已儲存項目的編輯。自訂條件可以編輯、複製或刪除。"
-- en: "Select an effect to edit its name, type and type-specific settings. The icon previews it live. Sequence sections edit animation, color, pulse or custom frames in order. Duplicate creates an independent effect. Drag a sequence card surface to reorder it; fields remain editable. New effects can be configured before naming. Apply saves the draft; Discard abandons edits to a saved entry. Import stages a validated replacement."
L["Select an effect to edit its name, type and type-specific settings. The icon previews it live. Sequence sections edit animation, color, pulse or custom frames in order. Duplicate creates an independent effect. Drag a sequence card surface to reorder it; fields remain editable. New effects can be configured before naming. Apply saves the draft; Discard abandons edits to a saved entry. Import stages a validated replacement."] = "選擇一個效果以編輯其名稱、類型及該類型特有的設定。圖示會即時預覽效果。序列部分依序編輯動畫、顏色、脈衝或自訂影格。「複製」會建立一個獨立的效果。拖曳序列卡片的表面可重新排序；欄位仍可編輯。新效果可以在命名前先進行設定。「套用」會儲存草稿；「捨棄」會丟棄對已儲存項目的編輯。「匯入」會暫存一個經過驗證的取代項目。"
-- en: "Choose an item set and edit its priority list. Global shares the set across profiles. Move arrows change item priority. Bind item set picks up an available item for placement on an action bar; The binding pill removes matching bound bar actions when unbinding, outside combat. Reset restores a packaged set. Search or drag items into reference fields. Apply saves settings; Discard abandons edits to a saved entry. Binding changes are explicit action-bar operations."
L["Choose an item set and edit its priority list. Global shares the set across profiles. Move arrows change item priority. Bind item set picks up an available item for placement on an action bar; The binding pill removes matching bound bar actions when unbinding, outside combat. Reset restores a packaged set. Search or drag items into reference fields. Apply saves settings; Discard abandons edits to a saved entry. Binding changes are explicit action-bar operations."] = "選擇一個物品組並編輯其優先順序清單。「全域」會在所有設定檔間共用該物品組。移動箭頭可變更物品優先順序。「綁定物品組」會拿起一件可用物品以放置到快捷列上；解除綁定時，綁定標籤會在非戰鬥狀態下移除快捷列上相符的已綁定動作。「重設」會還原內建的物品組。在參照欄位中搜尋或拖入物品。「套用」會儲存設定；「捨棄」會丟棄對已儲存項目的編輯。綁定的變更是明確的快捷列操作。"
-- en: "Press Enter or leave a text field to stage its value; Apply saves the draft. Invalid text stays red and must be corrected before Apply; Discard can abandon it. Searchable selectors open on click and filter as you type. Section headings collapse or expand their contents."
L["Press Enter or leave a text field to stage its value; Apply saves the draft. Invalid text stays red and must be corrected before Apply; Discard can abandon it. Searchable selectors open on click and filter as you type. Section headings collapse or expand their contents."] = "按 Enter 或離開文字欄位即可暫存其值；「套用」會儲存草稿。無效文字會維持紅色，必須在套用前更正；「捨棄」可以丟棄它。可搜尋的選擇器在點擊時開啟，並隨輸入進行篩選。分節標題可摺疊或展開其內容。"
-- en: "Apply changes to this selected item list. Other settings keep their own Apply action."
L["Apply changes to this selected item list. Other settings keep their own Apply action."] = "將變更套用到此所選物品清單。其他設定各自有其「套用」操作。"
-- en: "Choose an item list before editing."
L["Choose an item list before editing."] = "編輯前請先選擇一個物品清單。"
-- en: "The item list changed elsewhere. Close and reopen it before applying."
L["The item list changed elsewhere. Close and reopen it before applying."] = "物品清單已在別處變更。請關閉並重新開啟後再套用。"
-- en: "Editing this list"
L["Editing this list"] = "編輯此清單"
-- en: "This window edits only the item list you opened. Search or drag items into the fields, then arrange preferred items first. A named item set is shared by its other users; a custom list belongs to the calling condition or action draft. Applying this list does not apply the parent editor."
L["Help.ItemSets.popup.overview"] = "此視窗只編輯你開啟的物品清單。在欄位中搜尋或拖入物品，然後將首選物品排在前面。命名的物品組由其他使用者共用；自訂清單屬於呼叫它的條件或動作草稿。套用此清單不會套用其上層編輯器。"
-- en: "Use a row's red trash can to remove that entry from the draft list. This does not delete a named item set or remove an item from your inventory. The removal takes effect when you Apply this list."
L["Help.ItemSets.popup.delete"] = "使用某一列的紅色垃圾桶可將該項目從草稿清單中移除。這不會刪除命名的物品組，也不會從你的背包中移除物品。移除會在你套用此清單時生效。"
-- en: "Apply validates every entry and writes the edited list back to its original owner. Discard closes without changing it. Closing with pending edits offers Apply, Discard or Cancel; Cancel keeps this window open. View Changes compares the original list with this draft. If the original list changed elsewhere, close and reopen it before applying."
L["Help.ItemSets.popup.save"] = "「套用」會驗證每個項目，並將編輯後的清單寫回其原始擁有者。「捨棄」會關閉而不做變更。有待處理的編輯時關閉會提供「套用」「捨棄」或「取消」；「取消」會保持此視窗開啟。「檢視變更」會比較原始清單與此草稿。如果原始清單已在別處變更，請關閉並重新開啟後再套用。"
-- en: "Native settings page unavailable: %s"
L["Native settings page unavailable: %s"] = "原生設定頁面無法使用：%s"
-- en: "The native rotation editor is unavailable."
L["The native rotation editor is unavailable."] = "原生循環編輯器無法使用。"
-- en: "Required"
L["Required"] = "必填"
-- en: "Required field references need review. Apply keeps the displayed root requirements."
L["Required field references need review. Apply keeps the displayed root requirements."] = "必填欄位的參照需要檢查。「套用」會保留所顯示的根層級必填要求。"
-- en: "Required root fields must have a value before this condition can run. Rename, reorder and duplicate keep this flag; removing the field removes its requirement. Moving it into a nested structure makes it optional. Undo restores both. Callback code is unchanged."
L["Required root fields must have a value before this condition can run. Rename, reorder and duplicate keep this flag; removing the field removes its requirement. Moving it into a nested structure makes it optional. Undo restores both. Callback code is unchanged."] = "根層級必填欄位必須有值，此條件才能執行。重新命名、重新排序與複製都會保留此標記；移除欄位會移除其必填要求。將其移入巢狀結構會使其變為選填。復原會同時還原兩者。回呼程式碼保持不變。"
-- en: "Copy condition description"
L["Copy condition description"] = "複製條件說明"
-- en: "This condition exceeds the supported editor limits."
L["This condition exceeds the supported editor limits."] = "此條件超出了編輯器支援的上限。"
-- en: "Proc Glow"
L["Proc Glow"] = "觸發發光"
-- en: "Loop duration"
L["Loop duration"] = "循環時長"
-- en: "Start burst"
L["Start burst"] = "開場爆發"
-- en: "Proc Glow is unavailable on this client; Pixel glow will be used."
L["Proc Glow is unavailable on this client; Pixel glow will be used."] = "此用戶端不支援觸發發光；將改用像素發光。"
-- en: "Proc Glow: use the animated actionbar proc border from LibCustomGlow. Rotation Master checks the required game artwork and animation support before using it. Unsupported clients use Pixel glow instead; the definition remains portable. Color and offsets come from the profile or the cooldown."
L["Help.Effects.type.proc"] = "觸發發光：使用 LibCustomGlow 提供的快捷列觸發動畫邊框。Rotation Master 在使用前會檢查所需的遊戲美術資源與動畫支援。不支援的用戶端會改用像素發光；定義本身仍可攜。顏色與偏移來自設定檔或冷卻。"
-- en: "Time in seconds for one repeating proc-border animation, from 0.1 to 5. Use the slider or enter an exact value in its number field. Changing the value updates the preview."
L["Help.Effects.proc.duration"] = "一次重複的觸發邊框動畫所需的時間，單位為秒，範圍為 0.1 到 5。使用滑桿或在數字欄位中輸入精確值。變更數值會更新預覽。"
-- en: "Play the opening burst when this highlight first appears, then repeat its border animation. Off by default. Refreshing an already visible Proc Glow does not restart the burst."
L["Help.Effects.proc.startAnim"] = "在此醒目提示首次出現時播放開場爆發，然後重複其邊框動畫。預設關閉。重新整理已顯示的觸發發光不會重新播放爆發。"
-- en: "Rotation data requires recovery: %s"
L["Rotation data requires recovery: %s"] = "循環資料需要復原：%s"
-- en: "Copies belong to your Class unless This character is selected. Replacement keeps its original owner."
L["Copies belong to your Class unless This character is selected. Replacement keeps its original owner."] = "除非選擇了「此角色」，否則複本屬於你的職業。取代會保留其原始擁有者。"
-- en: "Archive report truncated; saved data is unchanged."
L["Archive report truncated; saved data is unchanged."] = "封存報告已截斷；已儲存的資料未變更。"
-- en: "Recover unassigned rotations"
L["Recover unassigned rotations"] = "復原未指派的循環"
-- en: "Ownership required"
L["Ownership required"] = "需要指定擁有者"
-- en: "These records have no assigned owner. Choose Class or This character explicitly. No ownership is inferred from names, spells or profile history."
L["These records have no assigned owner. Choose Class or This character explicitly. No ownership is inferred from names, spells or profile history."] = "這些記錄沒有指派擁有者。請明確選擇「職業」或「此角色」。不會根據名稱、法術或設定檔歷史推斷擁有權。"
-- en: "Recovery unavailable: %s"
L["Recovery unavailable: %s"] = "無法復原：%s"
-- en: "Unassigned rotation archive"
L["Unassigned rotation archive"] = "未指派循環封存"
-- en: "Character archive"
L["Character archive"] = "角色封存"
-- en: "Profile archive"
L["Profile archive"] = "設定檔封存"
-- en: "No unassigned rotations."
L["No unassigned rotations."] = "沒有未指派的循環。"
-- en: "Archive: %s; specialization: %s; identifier: %s"
L["Archive: %s; specialization: %s; identifier: %s"] = "封存：%s；專精：%s；識別碼：%s"
-- en: "Export archive"
L["Export archive"] = "匯出封存"
-- en: "Adopt rotation"
L["Adopt rotation"] = "認領循環"
-- en: "Could not adopt this record: %s"
L["Could not adopt this record: %s"] = "無法認領此記錄：%s"
-- en: "More than one rotation is named %s. Select its Class or This character entry in the rotation browser."
L["More than one rotation is named %s. Select its Class or This character entry in the rotation browser."] = "有多個循環名為 %s。請在循環瀏覽器中選擇其「職業」或「此角色」項目。"
-- en: "The fallback rotation is unavailable. Open Rotations to complete or recover it."
L["The fallback rotation is unavailable. Open Rotations to complete or recover it."] = "備用循環無法使用。請開啟「循環」以完成或復原它。"
-- en: "Class rotations are shared by characters of the same class in this settings profile. This character limits the rotation to your current character. Applying a scope change moves the complete saved rotation; an existing destination is never overwritten."
L["Class rotations are shared by characters of the same class in this settings profile. This character limits the rotation to your current character. Applying a scope change moves the complete saved rotation; an existing destination is never overwritten."] = "職業循環在此設定檔中由同一職業的角色共用。「此角色」會將循環限制為你目前的角色。套用範圍變更會移動整個已儲存的循環；永遠不會覆蓋已存在的目標。"
-- en: "Rotations belong to the active settings profile. New copies use Class, shared by your characters of that class; Metadata can change this to This character. Built In rotations show only for their declared class or universal use. Equal identifiers in different owners remain separate entries."
L["Rotations belong to the active settings profile. New copies use Class, shared by your characters of that class; Metadata can change this to This character. Built In rotations show only for their declared class or universal use. Equal identifiers in different owners remain separate entries."] = "循環屬於目前使用中的設定檔。新複本使用「職業」，由你該職業的所有角色共用；可在中繼資料中將其改為「此角色」。內建循環只對其宣告的職業或通用用途顯示。不同擁有者下的相同識別碼仍是各自獨立的項目。"
-- en: "Older rotations without a recorded owner stay in an archive. Recover unassigned rotations opens the current profile and character archives for inspection or copying. Choose Class or This character to adopt one. Adoption preserves its identifier and evidence, refuses an existing destination, and leaves incomplete records unavailable until repaired."
L["Older rotations without a recorded owner stay in an archive. Recover unassigned rotations opens the current profile and character archives for inspection or copying. Choose Class or This character to adopt one. Adoption preserves its identifier and evidence, refuses an existing destination, and leaves incomplete records unavailable until repaired."] = "沒有記錄擁有者的舊循環會保留在封存中。「復原未指派的循環」會開啟目前設定檔與角色的封存以供檢視或複製。選擇「職業」或「此角色」即可認領一個。認領會保留其識別碼與證據，拒絕已存在的目標，並讓不完整的記錄在修復前維持無法使用。"
-- en: "Unsupported condition editor frame."
L["Unsupported condition editor frame."] = "不支援的條件編輯器框架。"
-- en: "The native condition editor is unavailable."
L["The native condition editor is unavailable."] = "原生條件編輯器無法使用。"
-- en: "Native custom condition editor required."
L["Native custom condition editor required."] = "需要原生自訂條件編輯器。"
-- en: "Stock"
L["Stock"] = "原版"
-- en: "Target"
L["Target"] = "目標"
-- en: "you {{!have|do not have}} {item} equipped"
L["you {{!have|do not have}} {item} equipped"] = "你{{!已|未}}裝備{item}"
-- en: "{item} {{!is|is not}} available{carrying}"
L["{item} {{!is|is not}} available{carrying}"] = "{item}{{!可用|無法使用}}{carrying}"
-- en: "{item} {{!is|is not}} in range{carrying}"
L["{item} {{!is|is not}} in range{carrying}"] = "{item}{{!在|不在}}射程內{carrying}"
-- en: "the cooldown on {item} {comparison} {duration}{carrying}"
L["the cooldown on {item} {comparison} {duration}{carrying}"] = "{item}的冷卻{comparison}{duration}{carrying}"
-- en: "Questie"
L["Questie"] = "Questie"
-- en: "Enable Questie integration"
L["Enable Questie integration"] = "啟用 Questie 整合"
