-- en: "BigWigs (Boss Timers & Tools) for Retail, Forever, Classic and Classic progression. Its TOC also declares TBC Anniversary."
L["BigWigs (Boss Timers & Tools) for Retail, Forever, Classic and Classic progression. Its TOC also declares TBC Anniversary."] = "適用於正式版、永久、經典版與經典進程的 BigWigs（Boss Timers & Tools）。其 TOC 還宣告支援 TBC 週年版。"
