L["Fresh readable record with active, optional name, remainingSeconds and interruptible. Remaining time is in seconds and is clamped to zero. An unavailable optional field has its own reason; it does not invalidate a readable active name."] = "全新的可讀記錄，包含 active、選擇性的 name、remainingSeconds 與 interruptible。剩餘時間以秒為單位，並截斷為不小於零。無法使用的選擇性欄位有其自己的原因；它不會使可讀的 active 名稱失效。"
