L["Fresh readable record with exists and, when present, powerType and finite current quantity. Requested maximum is finite and nonnegative. Quantities may be fractional; current-mode current may be signed."] = "全新的可讀記錄，包含 exists，存在時還包含 powerType 與有限的目前數量。請求的最大值為有限的非負數。數量可以是小數；current 模式下的目前值可以帶正負號。"
