L["New table with stringified keys and unchanged values."] = "鍵被字串化、值保持不變的新表格。"
-- en: "Newest-first health snapshots containing time, value and max. Falsy input returns only zero without reading the clock."
L["Newest-first health snapshots containing time, value and max. Falsy input returns only zero without reading the clock."] = "以最新者在前的生命力快照，包含 time、value 與 max。為假值的輸入只傳回零，不會讀取時鐘。"
