L["Normalized bounded socket snapshot with slots and complete, or nil when the query is unavailable."] = "標準化的有限插槽快照，包含 slots 與 complete；查詢無法使用時為 nil。"
-- en: "Normalized requested subject with finite timeRemaining or timeRemainingReason; nil when the required row or subject is unavailable."
L["Normalized requested subject with finite timeRemaining or timeRemainingReason; nil when the required row or subject is unavailable."] = "標準化的所請求主題，包含有限的 timeRemaining 或 timeRemainingReason；所需的列或主題無法使用時為 nil。"
-- en: "Number of entries visited."
L["Number of entries visited."] = "走訪到的項目數量。"
-- en: "Number or string to inspect; other types do not match."
L["Number or string to inspect; other types do not match."] = "要檢查的數字或字串；其他型別不相符。"
-- en: "Numeric widget supporting slider bounds, percent display and pending-edit validation."
L["Numeric widget supporting slider bounds, percent display and pending-edit validation."] = "支援滑桿範圍、百分比顯示與待處理編輯驗證的數值元件。"
-- en: "Observation kind: cast or channel. These use different native interruptibility tuple positions."
L["Observation kind: cast or channel. These use different native interruptibility tuple positions."] = "觀測種類：cast 或 channel。它們使用原生可中斷元組中的不同位置。"
-- en: "Observation, history, work-limit or arithmetic availability reason."
L["Observation, history, work-limit or arithmetic availability reason."] = "觀測、歷史、工作量上限或運算的可用性原因。"
-- en: "Observe a fresh protected zero-argument GetTime for a needed health forecast. Require readability and a finite number; preserve signed and fractional values without adding a monotonic, integral or nonnegative restriction. No clock cache or extra native query is used."
L["Observe a fresh protected zero-argument GetTime for a needed health forecast. Require readability and a finite number; preserve signed and fractional values without adding a monotonic, integral or nonnegative restriction. No clock cache or extra native query is used."] = "為所需的生命力預測重新觀測一次受保護的無參數 GetTime。要求結果可讀且為有限數字；保留帶正負號與小數值，不額外加入單調、整數或非負的限制。不使用時鐘快取或額外的原生查詢。"
-- en: "Observe a readable raw unit level on known clients. A readable absent unit returns exists=false; present units require a positive finite integer UnitLevel. Unknown boss levels, missing, failed, restricted or malformed observations return nil with a reason. This does not use effective or scaled levels."
L["Observe a readable raw unit level on known clients. A readable absent unit returns exists=false; present units require a positive finite integer UnitLevel. Unknown boss levels, missing, failed, restricted or malformed observations return nil with a reason. This does not use effective or scaled levels."] = "在已知的用戶端上觀測可讀的原始單位等級。可讀且不存在的單位傳回 exists=false；存在的單位要求 UnitLevel 為正的有限整數。未知的首領等級，以及缺少、失敗、受限或格式錯誤的觀測會傳回 nil 及原因。這不使用有效等級或縮放後的等級。"
-- en: "Observe a selected unit role on probe-policy clients without issuing inspection requests. Known unit absence returns false. Prefer the callable modern inspection API, with legacy fallback only when that callable is absent; a selected failure never falls through. Require a positive finite integral specialization ID and consume only role return five from the exact one-argument GetSpecializationInfoByID call. Missing, failed, restricted or malformed required facts are unavailable; readable nonempty future role strings remain exact."
L["Observe a selected unit role on probe-policy clients without issuing inspection requests. Known unit absence returns false. Prefer the callable modern inspection API, with legacy fallback only when that callable is absent; a selected failure never falls through. Require a positive finite integral specialization ID and consume only role return five from the exact one-argument GetSpecializationInfoByID call. Missing, failed, restricted or malformed required facts are unavailable; readable nonempty future role strings remain exact."] = "在探測政策用戶端上觀測所選單位的職責，不發出觀察請求。已知單位不存在時傳回 false。優先使用可呼叫的現代觀察 API，僅當它不可呼叫時才改用舊版；所選 API 失敗時絕不會改用其他 API。要求專精 ID 為正的有限整數，並且只使用確切的單參數 GetSpecializationInfoByID 呼叫的第五個傳回值（職責）。所需資訊缺少、失敗、受限或格式錯誤時為無法使用；可讀的非空未來職責字串保持原樣。"
-- en: "Observe a unit casting or channeling on supported readable clients. A readable inactive result returns active=false. Active records contain name and independently available remainingSeconds and interruptible fields, with remainingReason or interruptibleReason when an optional field is unavailable. Missing, failed or restricted observations return nil with a reason."
L["Observe a unit casting or channeling on supported readable clients. A readable inactive result returns active=false. Active records contain name and independently available remainingSeconds and interruptible fields, with remainingReason or interruptibleReason when an optional field is unavailable. Missing, failed or restricted observations return nil with a reason."] = "在受支援且可讀的用戶端上觀測單位的施法或引導。可讀的非活躍結果傳回 active=false。活躍記錄包含 name，以及各自獨立可用的 remainingSeconds 與 interruptible 欄位；當選擇性欄位無法使用時附帶 remainingReason 或 interruptibleReason。缺少、失敗或受限的觀測會傳回 nil 及原因。"
-- en: "Observe creature identity from native UnitCreatureType return two on probe-policy clients. Check exact UnitExists(unit) first; readable false returns false without requiring or calling creature metadata. A present unit requires a readable finite numeric ID; the unused localized name does not affect availability. Preserve signed, fractional, zero and future finite IDs as known values. Missing, failed, nil, restricted or malformed required facts return nil with a reason. No creature enumeration, translated caption comparison or longterm cache is added."
L["Observe creature identity from native UnitCreatureType return two on probe-policy clients. Check exact UnitExists(unit) first; readable false returns false without requiring or calling creature metadata. A present unit requires a readable finite numeric ID; the unused localized name does not affect availability. Preserve signed, fractional, zero and future finite IDs as known values. Missing, failed, nil, restricted or malformed required facts return nil with a reason. No creature enumeration, translated caption comparison or longterm cache is added."] = "在探測政策用戶端上，從原生 UnitCreatureType 的第二個傳回值觀測生物身分。先檢查確切的 UnitExists(unit)；可讀的 false 會直接傳回 false，不需要也不呼叫生物中繼資料。存在的單位要求可讀的有限數字 ID；未使用的在地化名稱不影響可用性。帶正負號、小數、零以及未來的有限 ID 都會作為已知值保留。所需資訊缺少、失敗、為 nil、受限或格式錯誤時傳回 nil 及原因。不會新增生物列舉、翻譯標題比較或長期快取。"
-- en: "Observe death or ghost state, or friendliness to the player, for the exact selected unit on probe-policy clients. A missing, failed, restricted or malformed required observation is unavailable. Unit absence is unavailable rather than a negative match, including under NOT. No cross-poll state is retained."
L["Observe death or ghost state, or friendliness to the player, for the exact selected unit on probe-policy clients. A missing, failed, restricted or malformed required observation is unavailable. Unit absence is unavailable rather than a negative match, including under NOT. No cross-poll state is retained."] = "在探測政策用戶端上，觀測確切的所選單位是否死亡或處於鬼魂狀態，或是否對玩家友好。所需觀測缺少、失敗、受限或格式錯誤時為無法使用。單位不存在時為無法使用，而不是否定比對，在 NOT 下同樣如此。不會保留跨輪詢的狀態。"
-- en: "Observe exact pet existence and optionally its formatted GetUnitName display name. Presence-only queries never require name data. Known absence skips the name query. Present pets require a readable nonempty name only when requested; required missing, failed, nil, restricted or malformed observations return nil with a reason. The display helper is called with its single original pet argument, without UnitName fallback or inferred bar, health or ability state."
L["Observe exact pet existence and optionally its formatted GetUnitName display name. Presence-only queries never require name data. Known absence skips the name query. Present pets require a readable nonempty name only when requested; required missing, failed, nil, restricted or malformed observations return nil with a reason. The display helper is called with its single original pet argument, without UnitName fallback or inferred bar, health or ability state."] = "觀測寵物是否確切存在，並可選擇性地觀測其經 GetUnitName 格式化的顯示名稱。僅查詢存在性時從不需要名稱資料。已知不存在時會略過名稱查詢。僅在請求時，存在的寵物才需要可讀的非空名稱；所需觀測缺少、失敗、為 nil、受限或格式錯誤時傳回 nil 及原因。顯示輔助函式只以原有的單一寵物參數呼叫，不改用 UnitName，也不推斷快捷列、生命力或技能狀態。"
-- en: "Observe exact selected-unit existence and optionally its class filename for point-resource conditions. Known absence returns exists=false without reading class. Present units require only UnitClass return two when requested; unused localized names and IDs do not affect availability. Required missing, failed, restricted or malformed observations remain unavailable. This does not select a resource or cache identity."
L["Observe exact selected-unit existence and optionally its class filename for point-resource conditions. Known absence returns exists=false without reading class. Present units require only UnitClass return two when requested; unused localized names and IDs do not affect availability. Required missing, failed, restricted or malformed observations remain unavailable. This does not select a resource or cache identity."] = "為點數資源條件觀測確切的所選單位是否存在，並可選擇性地觀測其職業檔名。已知不存在時傳回 exists=false，不讀取職業。存在的單位只在請求時需要 UnitClass 的第二個傳回值；未使用的在地化名稱與 ID 不影響可用性。所需觀測缺少、失敗、受限或格式錯誤時維持為無法使用。這不會選擇資源或快取身分。"
-- en: "Observe explicit mana or the current raw power resource on supported readable clients. Select resource identities from the live PowerType enum; explicit mana never falls back to the current bar. Known absence returns exists=false; missing, failed, restricted or malformed observations return nil with a reason. Current-mode quantities preserve signed native resources; explicit mana is nonnegative. Request maximum only when needed; percentage consumers must require a positive maximum."
L["Observe explicit mana or the current raw power resource on supported readable clients. Select resource identities from the live PowerType enum; explicit mana never falls back to the current bar. Known absence returns exists=false; missing, failed, restricted or malformed observations return nil with a reason. Current-mode quantities preserve signed native resources; explicit mana is nonnegative. Request maximum only when needed; percentage consumers must require a positive maximum."] = "在受支援且可讀的用戶端上觀測明確的法力或目前的原始能量資源。資源身分從即時的 PowerType 列舉中選擇；明確法力絕不會改用目前能量條。已知不存在時傳回 exists=false；缺少、失敗、受限或格式錯誤的觀測會傳回 nil 及原因。current 模式下的數量保留帶正負號的原生資源；明確法力為非負。僅在需要時請求最大值；百分比的使用者必須要求最大值為正。"
-- en: "Observe glyph sockets on verified Wrath, Cata and Mists client layouts. Returns slots and a complete flag. Each slot has active=false when known locked or empty, active=true plus spellID when occupied, or nil active plus reason when unavailable. Unknown layouts and failed count queries return nil with a reason. This does not compare item names or prove exact item-to-spell identity."
L["Observe glyph sockets on verified Wrath, Cata and Mists client layouts. Returns slots and a complete flag. Each slot has active=false when known locked or empty, active=true plus spellID when occupied, or nil active plus reason when unavailable. Unknown layouts and failed count queries return nil with a reason. This does not compare item names or prove exact item-to-spell identity."] = "在已驗證的巫妖王之怒、浩劫與重生與潘達利亞之謎用戶端配置上觀測雕紋插槽。傳回 slots 與 complete 標記。每個插槽在已知鎖定或為空時為 active=false，被佔用時為 active=true 並附帶 spellID，無法使用時 active 為 nil 並附帶原因。未知配置與失敗的數量查詢會傳回 nil 及原因。這不會比較物品名稱，也不能證明物品與法術身分的確切對應。"
-- en: "Observe one consumed native unit metadata field after checking UnitExists: class uses UnitClass return two, creature uses the localized UnitCreatureType name, and classification uses UnitClassification. A readable absent unit returns false without querying metadata. Unused tuple fields do not affect availability; a required missing, failed, nil, restricted or malformed value returns nil with a reason. No player class, GUID, enum or translation inference is added."
L["Observe one consumed native unit metadata field after checking UnitExists: class uses UnitClass return two, creature uses the localized UnitCreatureType name, and classification uses UnitClassification. A readable absent unit returns false without querying metadata. Unused tuple fields do not affect availability; a required missing, failed, nil, restricted or malformed value returns nil with a reason. No player class, GUID, enum or translation inference is added."] = "在檢查 UnitExists 後觀測一個所使用的原生單位中繼資料欄位：class 使用 UnitClass 的第二個傳回值，creature 使用在地化的 UnitCreatureType 名稱，classification 使用 UnitClassification。可讀且不存在的單位傳回 false，不查詢中繼資料。未使用的元組欄位不影響可用性；所需的值缺少、失敗、為 nil、受限或格式錯誤時傳回 nil 及原因。不會新增玩家職業、GUID、列舉或翻譯推斷。"
-- en: "Observe one current unit flag: combat uses UnitAffectingCombat, enemy uses UnitIsEnemy with player as the first unit, and pvp uses UnitIsPVP. A readable absent unit returns false without querying the flag. Required missing, failed, restricted or malformed observations return nil with a reason. This preserves the exact selected unit and does not infer friendliness, attackability or other unit states."
L["Observe one current unit flag: combat uses UnitAffectingCombat, enemy uses UnitIsEnemy with player as the first unit, and pvp uses UnitIsPVP. A readable absent unit returns false without querying the flag. Required missing, failed, restricted or malformed observations return nil with a reason. This preserves the exact selected unit and does not infer friendliness, attackability or other unit states."] = "觀測一個目前的單位標記：combat 使用 UnitAffectingCombat，enemy 使用以 player 為第一個單位的 UnitIsEnemy，pvp 使用 UnitIsPVP。可讀且不存在的單位傳回 false，不查詢該標記。所需觀測缺少、失敗、受限或格式錯誤時傳回 nil 及原因。這會保留確切的所選單位，不推斷友好、可攻擊或其他單位狀態。"
-- en: "Observe one exact native rune slot using GetRuneType with its single index argument. Require a readable finite positive integral type; known future numeric types remain distinct from the selected type, and Death is an exact type rather than a wildcard. Missing, failed, restricted or malformed observations remain unavailable. No class, unit, count or inferred base-rune query is added."
L["Observe one exact native rune slot using GetRuneType with its single index argument. Require a readable finite positive integral type; known future numeric types remain distinct from the selected type, and Death is an exact type rather than a wildcard. Missing, failed, restricted or malformed observations remain unavailable. No class, unit, count or inferred base-rune query is added."] = "使用只帶單一索引參數的 GetRuneType 觀測一個確切的原生符文欄位。要求類型可讀且為正的有限整數；已知的未來數字類型與所選類型保持區分，死亡符文是一個確切的類型而不是萬用字元。缺少、失敗、受限或格式錯誤的觀測維持為無法使用。不會新增職業、單位、數量或推斷基礎符文的查詢。"
-- en: "Observe one independent zero-argument player flag: stealthed uses IsStealthed, control uses HasFullControl, and outdoors uses IsOutdoors. Readable true and false retain their meanings. Required missing, failed, nil, restricted or malformed data returns nil with a reason. No existence, instance or ability-usability inference is added."
L["Observe one independent zero-argument player flag: stealthed uses IsStealthed, control uses HasFullControl, and outdoors uses IsOutdoors. Readable true and false retain their meanings. Required missing, failed, nil, restricted or malformed data returns nil with a reason. No existence, instance or ability-usability inference is added."] = "觀測一個獨立的無參數玩家標記：stealthed 使用 IsStealthed，control 使用 HasFullControl，outdoors 使用 IsOutdoors。可讀的 true 與 false 保留其含義。所需資料缺少、失敗、為 nil、受限或格式錯誤時傳回 nil 及原因。不會新增存在性、副本或技能可用性的推斷。"
-- en: "Observe one protected zero-argument IsInInstance tuple. Required readable Boolean membership is independent of the type field: known outside returns without interpreting the unused type; inside returns a readable string type or an instanceTypeReason when that secondary field is unavailable. Callers testing outside need only membership; inside type comparisons must check the secondary reason. No outdoors, zone or unit inference is added."
L["Observe one protected zero-argument IsInInstance tuple. Required readable Boolean membership is independent of the type field: known outside returns without interpreting the unused type; inside returns a readable string type or an instanceTypeReason when that secondary field is unavailable. Callers testing outside need only membership; inside type comparisons must check the secondary reason. No outdoors, zone or unit inference is added."] = "觀測一個受保護的無參數 IsInInstance 元組。所需的可讀布林成員值與類型欄位無關：已知在副本外時直接傳回，不解釋未使用的類型；在副本內時傳回可讀的字串類型，或在該次要欄位無法使用時傳回 instanceTypeReason。檢測是否在副本外的呼叫端只需要成員值；在副本內比較類型時必須檢查次要原因。不會新增戶外、區域或單位推斷。"
-- en: "Observe ordered selected-unit existence, hostility from player, then the player threat status on that unit. Known absence, nonenemy and a successfully read nil threat status return false, preserving the no-threat predicate. Finite status numbers including zero retain their original comparison meaning. Required missing, failed, nil, restricted or malformed facts return nil with a reason. No attackability, death, combat or vehicle inference is added."
L["Observe ordered selected-unit existence, hostility from player, then the player threat status on that unit. Known absence, nonenemy and a successfully read nil threat status return false, preserving the no-threat predicate. Finite status numbers including zero retain their original comparison meaning. Required missing, failed, nil, restricted or malformed facts return nil with a reason. No attackability, death, combat or vehicle inference is added."] = "依序觀測所選單位是否存在、是否與玩家敵對，然後觀測玩家在該單位上的威脅值狀態。已知不存在、非敵人以及成功讀取到的 nil 威脅值狀態傳回 false，以保留「無威脅值」判斷。包括零在內的有限狀態數值保留其原有的比較含義。所需資訊缺少、失敗、為 nil、受限或格式錯誤時傳回 nil 及原因。不會新增可攻擊、死亡、戰鬥或載具的推斷。"
-- en: "Observe readable current health and optionally maximum health on supported clients. A readable absent unit returns exists=false. Missing, failed, restricted or malformed observations return nil with a reason; they do not establish an absent unit or a health value."
L["Observe readable current health and optionally maximum health on supported clients. A readable absent unit returns exists=false. Missing, failed, restricted or malformed observations return nil with a reason; they do not establish an absent unit or a health value."] = "在受支援的用戶端上觀測可讀的目前生命力，並可選擇性地觀測最大生命力。可讀且不存在的單位傳回 exists=false。缺少、失敗、受限或格式錯誤的觀測會傳回 nil 及原因；它們不能證明單位不存在或得出生命力。"
-- en: "Observe the current player form with one protected zero-argument GetShapeshiftForm call. Preserve every readable finite numeric result, including zero, signed and fractional values; no stronger native index domain is inferred. Missing, failed, nil, restricted or nonfinite data remains unavailable. No form count, class, spell ID, unit or optional argument is added."
L["Observe the current player form with one protected zero-argument GetShapeshiftForm call. Preserve every readable finite numeric result, including zero, signed and fractional values; no stronger native index domain is inferred. Missing, failed, nil, restricted or nonfinite data remains unavailable. No form count, class, spell ID, unit or optional argument is added."] = "使用一次受保護的無參數 GetShapeshiftForm 呼叫觀測玩家目前的形態。保留每個可讀的有限數字結果，包括零、帶正負號與小數值；不會推斷更嚴格的原生索引範圍。缺少、失敗、為 nil、受限或非有限的資料維持為無法使用。不會新增形態數量、職業、法術 ID、單位或選擇性參數。"
-- en: "Observe the effective statistic from native return two only. On probe-policy clients query exact UnitExists(unit), then UnitStat(unit,stat) for selector 1..5 or UnitArmor(unit) for selector 6. Known absence returns exists=false; missing, failed, restricted or nonfinite required facts return nil. Preserve finite signed, fractional and zero values; ignore all unused tuple fields. The 1..6 route is an RM selector policy, not a native value-domain limit."
L["Observe the effective statistic from native return two only. On probe-policy clients query exact UnitExists(unit), then UnitStat(unit,stat) for selector 1..5 or UnitArmor(unit) for selector 6. Known absence returns exists=false; missing, failed, restricted or nonfinite required facts return nil. Preserve finite signed, fractional and zero values; ignore all unused tuple fields. The 1..6 route is an RM selector policy, not a native value-domain limit."] = "只從原生的第二個傳回值觀測有效屬性。在探測政策用戶端上，先查詢確切的 UnitExists(unit)，然後對選擇器 1..5 查詢 UnitStat(unit,stat)，或對選擇器 6 查詢 UnitArmor(unit)。已知不存在時傳回 exists=false；所需資訊缺少、失敗、受限或非有限時傳回 nil。保留有限的帶正負號、小數與零值；忽略所有未使用的元組欄位。1..6 的路由是 RM 的選擇器政策，而非原生值域的限制。"
-- en: "Observe the explicitly selected TBC player combo transport. Current uses exactly GetComboPoints(player,target); maximum uses UnitPowerMax(player,powerType) with the original selector. Other families are unavailable here and must use their existing point-power observer. Preserve readable finite signed, fractional and zero values. Missing, failed, restricted or malformed data remains unavailable; a failed chosen combo query never falls back to UnitPower. This observes no other actor and adds no cache."
L["Observe the explicitly selected TBC player combo transport. Current uses exactly GetComboPoints(player,target); maximum uses UnitPowerMax(player,powerType) with the original selector. Other families are unavailable here and must use their existing point-power observer. Preserve readable finite signed, fractional and zero values. Missing, failed, restricted or malformed data remains unavailable; a failed chosen combo query never falls back to UnitPower. This observes no other actor and adds no cache."] = "觀測明確選擇的 TBC 玩家連擊點傳輸方式。current 只使用 GetComboPoints(player,target)；maximum 使用帶原始選擇器的 UnitPowerMax(player,powerType)。其他用戶端系列在此無法使用，必須使用其現有的點數能量觀測器。保留可讀的有限帶正負號、小數與零值。缺少、失敗、受限或格式錯誤的資料維持為無法使用；所選的連擊點查詢失敗時絕不會改用 UnitPower。這不會觀測其他角色，也不會新增快取。"
-- en: "Observe the first role result of the exact legacy GetTalentGroupRole(group) dot call on probe-policy clients. Forward the readable selected group unchanged, including nil as one argument; do not infer group bounds, substitute another API or query a player unit. The complete legacy primary declaration is not established. Missing, failed, restricted, empty or malformed role data is unavailable; readable nonempty future strings remain exact."
L["Observe the first role result of the exact legacy GetTalentGroupRole(group) dot call on probe-policy clients. Forward the readable selected group unchanged, including nil as one argument; do not infer group bounds, substitute another API or query a player unit. The complete legacy primary declaration is not established. Missing, failed, restricted, empty or malformed role data is unavailable; readable nonempty future strings remain exact."] = "在探測政策用戶端上，觀測確切的舊版 GetTalentGroupRole(group) 點號呼叫的第一個職責結果。將可讀的所選天賦組原樣轉送，包括將 nil 作為一個參數；不推斷天賦組範圍、不替換為其他 API，也不查詢玩家單位。完整的舊版主要宣告並未成立。職責資料缺少、失敗、受限、為空或格式錯誤時為無法使用；可讀的非空未來字串保持原樣。"
-- en: "Observe the first zone PvP classification result with one protected zero-argument dot call. Prefer callable C_PvP.GetZonePVPInfo and use the global helper only when the modern callable is absent. A successful nil or no returned values produces a known empty record; missing, failed, restricted or malformed observations remain unavailable. Readable empty and future strings retain their exact meaning, and unused return fields do not determine availability. Never switch backends after a modern result or failure."
L["Observe the first zone PvP classification result with one protected zero-argument dot call. Prefer callable C_PvP.GetZonePVPInfo and use the global helper only when the modern callable is absent. A successful nil or no returned values produces a known empty record; missing, failed, restricted or malformed observations remain unavailable. Readable empty and future strings retain their exact meaning, and unused return fields do not determine availability. Never switch backends after a modern result or failure."] = "使用一次受保護的無參數點號呼叫，觀測區域 PvP 分類的第一個結果。優先使用可呼叫的 C_PvP.GetZonePVPInfo，僅當現代 API 不可呼叫時才使用全域輔助函式。成功傳回 nil 或沒有傳回值時，會產生一個已知的空記錄；缺少、失敗、受限或格式錯誤的觀測維持為無法使用。可讀的空字串與未來字串保留其確切含義，未使用的傳回欄位不決定可用性。在現代 API 傳回結果或失敗後，絕不切換後端。"
-- en: "Observe the player current movement speed on supported readable clients. This queries GetUnitSpeed for player only, without testing another unit or redirecting vehicle ownership. Zero means stationary; positive finite fractional speeds remain valid. Missing, failed, restricted or malformed observations return nil with a reason."
L["Observe the player current movement speed on supported readable clients. This queries GetUnitSpeed for player only, without testing another unit or redirecting vehicle ownership. Zero means stationary; positive finite fractional speeds remain valid. Missing, failed, restricted or malformed observations return nil with a reason."] = "在受支援且可讀的用戶端上觀測玩家目前的移動速度。這只針對 player 查詢 GetUnitSpeed，不檢測其他單位，也不重新導向載具擁有權。零表示靜止；正的有限小數速度仍然有效。缺少、失敗、受限或格式錯誤的觀測會傳回 nil 及原因。"
-- en: "Observe unit presence on identified client families. Pass the selected unit unchanged to one protected UnitExists call. Preserve readable true and false; missing, failed, restricted, nil or malformed required observations return nil with a reason. No identity, visibility, range or combat-state query is added."
L["Observe unit presence on identified client families. Pass the selected unit unchanged to one protected UnitExists call. Preserve readable true and false; missing, failed, restricted, nil or malformed required observations return nil with a reason. No identity, visibility, range or combat-state query is added."] = "在已識別的用戶端系列上觀測單位的存在性。將所選單位原樣傳給一次受保護的 UnitExists 呼叫。保留可讀的 true 與 false；所需觀測缺少、失敗、受限、為 nil 或格式錯誤時傳回 nil 及原因。不會新增身分、可見性、距離或戰鬥狀態的查詢。"
-- en: "Observe whether the player can attack a selected unit that is not dead, using the exact UnitExists, UnitCanAttack and UnitIsDead predicates. Known absence or a readable false attack result returns false without querying death. Required missing, failed, restricted or malformed observations return nil with a reason. This does not test ghosts, range, hostility or ability usability, and does not redirect unit ownership."
L["Observe whether the player can attack a selected unit that is not dead, using the exact UnitExists, UnitCanAttack and UnitIsDead predicates. Known absence or a readable false attack result returns false without querying death. Required missing, failed, restricted or malformed observations return nil with a reason. This does not test ghosts, range, hostility or ability usability, and does not redirect unit ownership."] = "使用確切的 UnitExists、UnitCanAttack 與 UnitIsDead 判斷，觀測玩家是否可以攻擊一個未死亡的所選單位。已知不存在或可讀的不可攻擊結果會傳回 false，不查詢死亡狀態。所需觀測缺少、失敗、受限或格式錯誤時傳回 nil 及原因。這不檢測鬼魂狀態、距離、敵對狀態或技能可用性，也不重新導向單位擁有權。"
-- en: "Observed class filename string, false for a known absent unit, or nil when unavailable."
L["Observed class filename string, false for a known absent unit, or nil when unavailable."] = "觀測到的職業檔名字串；已知單位不存在時為 false，無法使用時為 nil。"
-- en: "Observed membership, or nil when unavailable."
L["Observed membership, or nil when unavailable."] = "觀測到的成員身分；無法使用時為 nil。"
-- en: "On a selected resource only, target-combo for the explicit TBC player fallback or power for the existing selected-unit transport."
L["On a selected resource only, target-combo for the explicit TBC player fallback or power for the existing selected-unit transport."] = "僅限所選資源：target-combo 用於明確的 TBC 玩家備用，power 用於現有的所選單位傳輸方式。"
-- en: "On probe-policy clients observe exact UnitExists(unit), then UnitGUID(unit) only for a present unit. Known absence is false. Present identity requires a readable nonempty GUID; missing, failed, malformed or restricted required facts are unavailable. No health, provider or extra-unit observation is added."
L["On probe-policy clients observe exact UnitExists(unit), then UnitGUID(unit) only for a present unit. Known absence is false. Present identity requires a readable nonempty GUID; missing, failed, malformed or restricted required facts are unavailable. No health, provider or extra-unit observation is added."] = "在探測政策用戶端上觀測確切的 UnitExists(unit)，然後僅對存在的單位觀測 UnitGUID(unit)。已知不存在時為 false。存在的身分要求可讀的非空 GUID；所需資訊缺少、失敗、格式錯誤或受限時為無法使用。不會新增生命力、提供者或額外單位的觀測。"
-- en: "One of class, creature or classification; other metadata kinds are unsupported."
L["One of class, creature or classification; other metadata kinds are unsupported."] = "class、creature 或 classification 之一；不支援其他中繼資料種類。"
-- en: "One of combat, enemy or pvp; other flag kinds are not supported."
